H(/^👀 watch .*battle here$/i, '👀 Watch their battle here', 'Opens a small window inside Movie Royal with your co-streamer\'s battle (their real game screen). Drag it by its top bar, ⤢ makes it bigger. It closes by itself 15 seconds after their battle ends. Note: each picture you watch is one more copy your friend sends, so close it if their internet struggles.');
H(/pop up a note here with a watch button/i, '👀 Watch note', 'When your co-streamer\'s battle starts (any kind: Discord battles, their own battles, character and card battles), a note pops up in Movie Royal with a 👀 Watch button.');
H(/^tip:bigger \/ smaller$/i, '⤢ Bigger / smaller', 'Makes the watch window bigger or smaller (it remembers).');
H(/^tip:close \(it opens again with 👀 watch\)$/i, '✕ Close', 'Closes the watch window. 👀 Watch (in the note, or Settings → 🤝 Co-stream) opens it again.');

// ───────── 1.72.0: ⏪ undo all the way back · 🍀 luck in your own battles · 🧾 History → Everything ─────────
SECTION('The Wheel');
H(/^tip:take back everything since this wheel's first spin|all the way back to the start$/i, '⏮️ All the way back to the start', 'Takes this wheel back to right before its first spin (since its last ↺ Reset): every spin, grow, void, round timer and saved spin since then is taken back, one big undo. It asks first and says if another wheel changed since then (that one goes back too). 🧾 History → Everything still lists everything that was taken back.');
H(/^tip:put everything back the way it was right before this|^⏪ [\d,]+ steps?$/i, '⏪ Go back this many steps', 'Puts everything back the way it was right before this step: the wheel (and any other wheel that changed since), spot sizes, the round timer, saved spins and streamer respins. The timer waits for you after going back.');
H(/^show older steps…$/i, 'Show older steps…', 'Shows the next older steps in the ⏪ Go back… list. Every step is kept (the newest 10,000), even after you close Movie Royal.');
H(/^⏪ go back…$|^tip:go back several steps$/i, '⏪ Go back…', 'Lists every step you can take back, newest first, all the way to the start of the wheel (even after closing the app). Pick how far to go back, or ⏮️ all the way back to the start.');
SECTION('History & who won what');
H(/^tip:the complete history: everything that happens|^🧾 everything$/i, '🧾 Everything', 'The complete history: a line for everything that happens in Movie Royal, newest first, kept for good. Every spin and where it landed, every battle and who won (with everyone\'s chance and luck), luck earned, lost and started over, card packs that won, free spins, channel points, subs, bits, tips, chat joins, Discord picks and more. Nothing is ever taken out of it, not even by ⏪ undo (that\'s added as its own line).');
H(/^tip:every kind of thing$|^📋 all kinds$/i, '📋 All kinds', 'Shows every kind of line in 🧾 Everything (no kinds picked).');
H(/^tip:only .* \(click more than one to see several\)$/i, 'Kinds of things', 'Shows only that kind of line (🎡 wheel, ⚔️ battles, 🍀 luck, 🃏 card battles, 🎟️ free spins, 💜 channel points, 💵 subs/bits/tips, 💬 chat, 🎬 Discord picks, 📺 stream). Click more than one to see several at once; 📋 Everything shows them all again.');
H(/^tip:show practice battles, pretend tests|^🧪 practice & tests$/i, '🧪 Practice & tests', 'Ticked = practice battles, pretend tests and other 🧪 test lines show up in 🧾 Everything too (a bit faded). Untick it to see only the real things.');
H(/^tip:download the complete history/i, '⬇️ Download', 'Downloads the complete history as a spreadsheet file (.csv) you can open in Excel or Google Sheets, with the kinds and search you picked.');
H(/^show older…$/i, 'Show older…', 'Loads the next older lines of 🧾 Everything (300 at a time).');
H(/^\d+ more$/i, 'more', 'Opens the details of this line: everyone in a battle with their chance and luck, the finishing order, who got luck and how much, and so on.');
H(/search everything: a name/i, '🔎 Search', 'Finds lines in 🧾 Everything with these words: a name, a spot, a movie, a battle… It searches every day, not just the ones showing.');
SECTION('Luck');
H(/^tip:🍀 luck like the discord battle: everything that loses|^🍀 luck (on|off)/i, '🍀 Luck (this battle)', 'Your own battles can have the Discord battle\'s luck (off by default): every battle, everything that loses gets a little luckier, and a winner stays in with its luck starting over. Only you take things out. Click to turn it on or off for this battle; how much is in Settings → 🍀 Luck.');
H(/^tip:luck like the discord battle for this battle|^🍀 luck like the discord battle (on|off)$/i, '🍀 Luck like the Discord battle', 'Turns luck on or off for this one battle (off by default), saved right away. Every battle it loses, an entry gets the % in the box; when it wins it stays in and its luck goes back to 0%. Turning it off keeps the luck they have, it just doesn\'t count.');
H(/^tip:how much luck everything that loses a battle gets/i, '🍀 How much luck', 'How much luck (%) everything that loses one battle gets in this battle. 1% by default (the same as the Discord battle).');
H(/^tip:like the discord battle: everything that loses gets a little luckier|^🍀 luck like the discord battle: what loses/i, '🍀 Luck like the Discord battle', 'Makes the new battle with luck on: everything that loses gets a little luckier every battle, and a winner stays in with its luck starting over. You can turn it off later.');
H(/^tip:luck: it grows every battle it loses|^tip:luck: extra % chance \(it grows/i, '🍀 Luck', 'This entry\'s luck: it grows every battle it loses and starts over when it wins. You can type a new number to change it.');
SECTION('Testing features');
H(/^tip:a pretend wheel gets changed, then goes all the way back|^🤖 check it \(pretend wheel\)$/i, '🤖 Check undo (pretend wheel)', 'A pretend wheel nobody sees gets grown, shrunk, voided and brought back, counted down and made the same size, then goes ⏮️ all the way back to its start. It checks the wheel is exactly how it began and that nothing else changed. Your real wheels aren\'t touched.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:the real ⏪ go back… list|^⏪ open go back…$/i, '⏪ Open Go back…', 'Opens the 🎡 Wheel tab with its ⏪ Go back… list for the wheel you have picked.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:which battle's entries and luck amount to use/i, '🍀 Which battle', 'Pick one of your own battles to use its entries and its luck amount, or the made-up “stuff to do” list.', ['test']);
H(/^🍀 6 pretend battles$/i, '🍀 6 pretend battles', 'Plays 6 pretend battles with 🍀 luck on and shows who won each one (with its chance) and everyone\'s luck after it. Nothing real changes.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:adds one 🧪 test line|^➕ add a test line$/i, '➕ Add a test line', 'Adds one 🧪 test line to History → 🧾 Everything so you can see it show up. The 🧪 Practice & tests switch there hides it.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a practice battle: its start and winner show up in history/i, '⚔️ Practice battle', 'A practice battle with 6 made-up pieces: its start (with everyone\'s chance) and its winner show up in History → 🧾 Everything as 🧪 practice lines. Nothing real changes.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:opens history → 🧾 everything|^🧾 open it$/i, '🧾 Open it', 'Opens History → 🧾 Everything.', ['test']);

// ───────── 🤝 Co-stream (Settings → 🤝 Co-stream, 1.71.0) ─────────
SECTION('🤝 Co-stream with a friend');
H(/^🤝 co-stream$/i, '🤝 Co-stream', 'Settings for co-streaming with a friend: link your two Movie Royals with an invite code, send each other your camera and battle, and send chat\'s chaos into each other\'s battles.');
H(/make an invite code/i, '🎟️ Make an invite code', 'Makes a private room on your ☁️ 24/7 Discord bot and a code for it. Send the code to your friend (a Discord DM is fine). Pressing it again gives the same code until you stop co-streaming.', /co-stream/i);
H(/^🤝 join$|^join$/i, '🤝 Join', 'Joins your friend\'s room with the code they sent you. After that Movie Royal reconnects by itself every time it opens, until you press 🚪 Stop co-streaming.', /co-stream/i);
H(/^mrco1|^#cocode$/i, 'Invite code box', 'Paste the code your friend sent you here (it starts with MRCO1-), then press 🤝 Join.', /co-stream/i);
H(/i did it, hide this/i, '✅ I did it, hide this', 'Hides the one-time OBS reminder once you\'ve set the Virtual Camera to Output type: Scene → 🤝 Co-stream share. "📌 Show the one-time OBS setting again" brings it back.', /co-stream/i);
H(/skip cameras/i, '⏭️ Skip cameras', 'Co-stream without cameras: nothing is sent or added to OBS, but chaos still crosses between your chats and you both see when the other\'s battle is running. Turn 📤 Send my camera + battle back on any time.', /co-stream/i);
H(/show the one-time obs setting again/i, '📌 OBS setting again', 'Shows the one-time OBS reminder again (Virtual Camera → Output type: Scene → 🤝 Co-stream share).', /co-stream/i);
H(/^tip:read the scene list from obs/i, '🔄 Read my scenes', 'Asks OBS for your scene list, so you can pick which scene gets your friend\'s picture.', /co-stream/i);
H(/^your invite code$|^tip:your invite code/i, 'Your invite code', 'The code your friend pastes into their Movie Royal (Settings → 🤝 Co-stream → Join). Click it to select it, or press 📋 Copy.', /co-stream/i);
H(/scene showing when it's first added|^#coscene$/i, '🎬 Scene for their picture', 'Which of your OBS scenes gets your friend\'s camera and battle. Empty = the scene that was showing when it was first added. 🔄 reads your scene list from OBS.', /co-stream/i);
H(/copy invite code/i, '📋 Copy invite code', 'Copies your code so you can paste it to your friend in Discord.', /co-stream/i);
H(/chaos across chats/i, '⚡ Chaos across chats', 'While YOUR battle isn\'t running and your friend\'s is, your viewers\' channel point and bits chaos (comets, earthquakes…) goes into their battle, and your chat sees "sent a Comet into …\'s battle!". Theirs comes into yours the same way. While your own battle runs, your chaos stays in yours. Off = each chat only hits its own streamer\'s battles. Both of you have to leave it on for chaos to cross.', /co-stream/i);
H(/battle on my stream by itself/i, '⚔️ Show their battle by itself', 'Their battle shows on your stream (in OBS) while it runs, and hides again when it ends. Off = it stays however you set it in OBS (the piece is called "🤝 their name (co-stream)").', /co-stream/i);
H(/camera on my stream/i, '📷 Show their camera', 'Shows or hides your friend\'s camera piece in your OBS. Move and resize it in OBS like any source: Movie Royal won\'t move it back.', /co-stream/i);
H(/send my camera \+ battle/i, '📤 Send my camera + battle', 'Sends your camera and your game screen to your friend: OBS\'s Virtual Camera shows the "🤝 Co-stream share" scene, and a hidden window sends it (VDO.Ninja, free, about a quarter second behind). It\'s the real game screen from your OBS, so they see the exact same fight. No sound is sent: voices stay on Discord.', /co-stream/i);
H(/my camera's side|^⬅️ left|^➡️ right/i, '↔️ My camera\'s side', 'Which side of BOTH streams your camera is on. Your friend\'s camera goes on the other side: Movie Royal puts it there in your OBS, and puts yours on your side in theirs. Put your own camera on your side in your own OBS. The one who invites starts on the right, the one who joins on the left.', /co-stream/i);
H(/picture quality i send/i, '📶 Picture quality', 'How sharp the picture you send is. Low ≈ 1.2 Mbps of upload (slow internet), Normal ≈ 2.5, High ≈ 4. If 🩺 Lag check shows dropped frames, pick Low.', /co-stream/i);
H(/obs scene for/i, '🎬 Scene for their picture', 'Which of your OBS scenes gets your friend\'s camera and battle. Empty = the scene that was showing when it was first added. 🔄 reads your scene list from OBS. To have them in more scenes: in OBS, copy the piece and Paste (Reference).', /co-stream/i);
H(/what my partner sees/i, '👀 What my partner sees', 'Opens a window with your own picture as your friend gets it. If it\'s your whole stream instead of your camera + battle, set OBS\'s Virtual Camera to Output type: Scene → 🤝 Co-stream share (the ⚙ next to Start Virtual Camera).', /co-stream/i);
H(/['’]s picture$|^👀 their picture/i, '👀 Their picture', 'Opens a window with your friend\'s picture (their camera + battle), to check it\'s coming through.', /co-stream/i);
H(/set obs up again/i, '🔧 Set OBS up again', 'Fixes everything in OBS again: your share scene (camera + game screen), the Virtual Camera, and your friend\'s picture with its two pieces. Use it after you change your camera or game screen in OBS.', /co-stream/i);
H(/lag check/i, '🩺 Lag check', 'For 30 seconds shows what OBS sees: 🌐 dropped frames = the internet can\'t keep up (pick 📶 Low, or have whoever shares the Discord video share in 720p), 🖥️ skipped frames = the PC can\'t keep up (OBS → Settings → Output: use the hardware encoder NVENC / AMF / QuickSync). Green = fine.', /co-stream/i);
H(/stop co-streaming/i, '🚪 Stop co-streaming', 'Leaves the room, stops sending your picture (and the Virtual Camera, if Movie Royal started it) and takes your friend\'s picture out of your OBS. Join again with a code any time.', /co-stream/i);
H(/update the bot/i, '🔄 Update the bot', 'Puts the newest 24/7 Discord bot on Cloudflare (it hosts the co-stream room). Paste your Cloudflare API token first.', /co-stream/i);
H(/pretend partner/i, '🤝 Pretend partner', 'A pretend co-streamer for 10 minutes, so you can try co-streaming alone: with their battle "running" and yours not, your viewers\' chaos goes to them. Nothing is sent anywhere.', ['test']);
H(/their battle ends|their battle starts/i, '⏸ / ▶ Their battle', 'Makes the pretend partner\'s battle stop or start, to see where chaos goes.', ['test']);
H(/my viewer redeems a comet/i, '☄️ My viewer redeems a comet', 'A pretend viewer of yours redeems Comet: it says where it went (your battle, the pretend partner\'s battle, or waiting for your next battle).', ['test']);
H(/chaos from their chat/i, '☄️ Chaos from their chat', 'A comet from the partner\'s chat lands in YOUR battle (start a test battle first to see it).', ['test']);
H(/check invite codes/i, '🎟️ Check invite codes', 'Makes a pretend invite code and reads it back, to check codes work.', ['test']);
SECTION(null);

// ───────── top bar ─────────
H(/^tip:how long this battle lasts/i, '⏱️ This battle\'s timer', 'How long this battle lasts. All the way left (🌐) = it uses the timer for all battles. 🏁 On race maps it\'s the race time. Saves right away.');
H(/^tip:how hard the knockouts are spread over this battle/i, '⏳ This battle\'s pacer', 'How hard the knockouts are spread over this battle\'s timer (0 = off: pieces go out whenever they go out). All the way left (🌐) = it uses the pacer for all battles. Saves right away.');
H(/^tip:how long a battle lasts$/i, '⏱️ Battle timer (all battles)', 'How long a fight lasts, for every battle that doesn\'t have its own timer below. Saves right away.');
H(/^tip:how hard the knockouts are spread over the battle \(0/i, '⏳ Elimination pacer (all battles)', 'Spreads the knockouts over the whole fight so it doesn\'t empty out in the first seconds, and makes it busier when it drags. It never holds them back for long: about 7 seconds at most without a knockout. For every battle that doesn\'t have its own pacer below. 0 = off. Saves right away.');
H(/^tip:how long this card fight/i, '⏱️ Card fight length', 'How long this card battle\'s fight should last (the same slider as in the 🃏 Card pool tab). All the way left = it picks a length from how many packs fight.');
H(/^tip:how hard the knockouts are spread over this card fight/i, '⏳ Card fight pacer', 'How hard the knockouts are spread over this card battle\'s fight (0 = off). The same slider as in the 🃏 Card pool tab.');
H(/^⏱️ battle timer & ⏳ elimination pacer$/i, '⏱️ Battle timer & ⏳ pacer', 'One timer and pacer for all battles, and each battle (Discord movies, chat battle, giveaway, your own battles, card battles) can have its own. Slide a battle all the way left to use the ones for all battles.');
H(/^tip:which battle's timer and pacer to try|^▶ pretend battle with its timer & pacer$/i, '🧪 Timer & pacer test', 'Runs a pretend battle (made-up movies, nothing saved) with the picked battle\'s own timer and pacer, so you can see how long it lasts and how the knockouts spread.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:settings → game: the battle timer|^⚙ change the sliders$/i, '⚙ Timer & pacer sliders', 'Opens Settings → ⚔️ Game at the battle timer and elimination pacer sliders.', ['test']);
H(/^⏱️ battle timer & ⏳ pacer for each battle$/i, '🧪 Timer & pacer test', 'Try a battle\'s own timer and pacer with a pretend battle.', ['test']);
H(/^each battle \(slide all the way left/i, '⏱️⏳ Each battle', 'A battle timer and pacer for every battle. Slide one all the way left (🌐) and that battle uses the ones for all battles above.');
H(/^⏱️ battle timer: /i, '⏱️ Battle timer', 'How long the battle lasts. 🌐 Same as all battles = it uses the 🌐 All battles timer. Saves right away.');
H(/^🔮 chat calls the winner$/i, '🔮 Chat calls the winner', 'Twitch chat can call the winner before a Discord movie battle starts (!call and part of a title). If they\'re right, their own movies get extra luck.');
H(/^tip:how the wild spots get luck|^how .* spots get luck$/i, '🎟️ Wild spot luck', 'How the wild (Kirb) spots get luck when they lose. 🌙 Once a night (default): +1% the first time they lose a Discord movie battle while you\'re live, and nothing more that stream (1 battle or 3, still +1%). ⚔️ Every battle: like everyone else\'s movies. 🚫 No luck.');
H(/once a night: how much/i, '🌙 Once a night amount', 'How much luck a wild spot gets on a night it loses a Discord movie battle while you\'re live (default 1%).');
H(/wild spot luck$/i, '🎟️ Wild spot luck', 'How the wild spots get luck: 🌙 once a night (default), ⚔️ every battle like everyone else, or 🚫 none.');
H(/^tip:which wild spot luck rule to try|^tip:how many battles a night|^🎟️ try it$/i, '🧪 Wild spot luck test', 'Pretends a wild spot loses Discord movie battles two nights in a row and shows the luck it would get each battle, live and not live. Nothing real changes.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:how long this wheel spins/i, '🎡 Wheel spin time', 'How long this wheel spins, in seconds. Same as 🎡 Wheel → this wheel\'s ⚙ settings → Spin time. Saves right away.');
H(/^🎡 wheel spin time/i, '🎡 Wheel spin time', 'Every wheel\'s spin time in one place, next to the battle timers.');
H(/^tip:search the series by name or movie/i, '🔍 Find a series', 'Search the series by their name or one of their movies.');
H(/^tip:add a series by typing one of its movies|^➕ add a series$/i, '➕ Add a series', 'Type one of its movies: Movie Royal finds the whole series on TMDB and bans its later movies until you\'ve watched the ones before. (It also finds series by itself: when people pick from one, and every time it opens.)');
H(/^tip:check every series again now/i, '🔄 Check the series now', 'Checks every series again (what you\'ve watched, who has which series locked) and looks for new series: the ones of movies you watched on Letterboxd and popular ones. Movie Royal also does this by itself as the last thing when it opens.');
H(/^tip:lock this series for someone/i, '🔒 Series lock', 'Who gets first pick of this series\' next movie. Movie Royal sets this by itself (whoever picks the next movie gets it); change it here if you need to. 🔓 Open for everyone = anyone can pick the next one. A lock you set works like the automatic one: if they use their next picks on other movies, it opens up for everyone.');
H(/^🎞️ series$/i, '🎞️ Series', 'Series in order (later movies are banned until you\'ve watched the one before) and 🔒 locks (whoever picks the next movie of a series gets first pick of the rest of it).');
H(/^🎞️ run the pretend series$|^🎞️ series in order \+ 🔒 series locks$/i, '🧪 Series test', 'Walks a pretend series through every step of the series rules and shows what people would be told. Nothing real changes.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:open 🚫 banned movies → 🎞️ series|^↗ see the real series$/i, '↗ See the real series', 'Opens 🚫 Banned Movies → 🎞️ Series.', ['test']);
H(/no races with more than this many pieces/i, '🏁 Most pieces for a race', 'Races (Figure 8 and the race maps) only happen with this many pieces or fewer (50 by default). With more, a race map is skipped: 🎲 Random and the chat map vote leave them out, a race you picked switches to another map when the battle starts, and the race maps are greyed out in the map menu.');
H(/^tip:a practice battle with one more piece than races allow|^🏁 too many for a race\?$/i, '🧪 Too many for a race', 'Starts a practice battle with one more piece than races allow, on the race map picked next to it: it should go on another map instead.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:walk through a pretend stream night|^🌙 walk through a stream night$/i, '🧪 One stream night', 'Walks through a pretend stream night to show the movie count (Movie #1, #2… tonight) only starts over after more than an hour offline: going past midnight or a short internet drop keeps the same night. Nothing is saved.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a practice race with 16 made-up racers so you can see|^🏆 standings board$/i, '🧪 Standings board', 'Starts a practice race with 16 made-up racers on the picked race map so you can see the 🏁 standings board: the top 10 places down the right side of the screen. Races without laps (Last Bus Standing) and every other map have no board.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:how big every map is|^📏 map size/i, '📏 Map size', 'How big every ball map is (50% to 200%, 100% = normal): bigger cliffs and arenas, and longer race tracks (the cars go faster on a longer track, so a lap takes about the same time). The camera zooms out to fit. It works for every battle and changes the cliff right away (not during a battle). Character-only maps (Kung Fu Town, Royal Rumble…) keep their size.');
H(/^tip:which map size to try|^tip:which map to try it on/i, '🧪 Map size test', 'Pick a size and a map, then ▶ Try it: a practice battle at that size. Your real map size doesn\'t change.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:type a few letters of any setting/i, '🔍 Search all settings', 'Type a few letters of anything in Settings (like "volume", "laps", "bits" or "raid"): every match shows with the tab and section it\'s in. Click one (or press Enter for the first) and it jumps there and lights it up. Esc clears it.');
H(/^tip:characters instead of balls in this battle \(the same/i, '🧍 Characters (this battle)', 'Characters instead of balls in this one battle: the same as the 🧍 box on its tab.');
H(/^tip:what to search for in settings|^🔍 search settings$/i, '🧪 Settings search test', 'Opens Settings and searches for the word in the box.', ['test']);
H(/^🧍 characters$/i, '🧍 Characters (this battle)', 'Characters instead of balls in this one battle: the same as the 🧍 box on its tab.');
H(/battles use characters by default/i, '🧍 Characters by default', 'Every battle uses characters instead of balls, unless you changed that battle\'s own 🧍 box (on its tab, or in ⚔️ Game → Each battle).');
H(/^🎩 head accessory$|^🎀 hair accessory$/i, '🎩🎀 Accessories', 'A hat, glasses, crown… (head accessory) or a bow, clip or band (hair accessory) for this wild spot character. 1 = none.');
H(/chat command that lists the chat commands/i, '!moviesroyal command', 'The chat command viewers type to see every Movie Royal chat command that works on the tab you\'re on right now.');
H(/^⚔️ battle tab \(discord movie battle\)$|^🎲 chat battle tab$|^🎁 giveaway tab$|^🎡 wheel tab$/i, '📣 Chat message for this tab', 'The words the 📣 hourly chat message posts while you\'re on this tab. {discord} = your Discord invite link. Empty = the ready-made message.', ['chat messages']);
H(/little pop-ups at the bottom stay for/i, '💬 Pop-ups stay for', 'How many seconds the little messages at the bottom of Movie Royal stay (longer messages stay longer). Hover one to keep it, click it to close it.');
H(/^turn it on$/i, '🎨 Turn the holiday style on', 'Turns on this holiday\'s look for Movie Royal now.', ['app style', 'app & background']);
H(/^tip:battle again right away, without the movie that was passed|^🔁 redo the battle without/i, '🔁 Redo without the passed movie', 'The winner passed: start the battle again right away without their movie (it\'s back in after that). It shows on the right after a pass.');
H(/skip one battle” chat command|skip one battle" chat command|^!skip$/i, '⏭️ !skip command', 'Viewers type it with a number or a title (!skip 2, !skip Heat) and that movie of theirs sits out the next battle, then it\'s back. The same again puts it back in. With one movie, !skip is enough; with more, the bot lists them with numbers.');
H(/^tip:a pretend winner passes in chat|^🏆 winner passes$/i, '🧪 Winner passes', 'A pretend movie winner types !pass in the pretend chat, the bot asks if they want to sit out the rest of tonight, and they answer yes. A pretend winner changes nothing. The 🔁 Redo button then shows on the Battle tab.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a viewer types !skip 1|^⏭️ someone skips a movie$/i, '🧪 Someone skips a movie', 'A viewer with movies types !skip 1 in the pretend chat (that movie sits out the next battle), then again 8 seconds later to put it back.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:download the movies you banned|^⬇️ export my bans$|^⬇️ download it$/i, '⬇️ Export my bans', 'Downloads the movies YOU banned (not the automatic ones: not in English, religious, documentaries, this year\'s, sequels) as a spreadsheet file (.csv: TMDB id, title, year, reason, date). Open it in Excel, keep it as a copy, or ⬆️ Import it on another PC.');
H(/^tip:add the bans from an exported file|^⬆️ import bans$/i, '⬆️ Import bans', 'Pick a file you exported with ⬇️ Export my bans: its movies are added as your own bans (ones already banned are skipped, nothing is removed). Like banning by hand, a movie that\'s in the pool comes out.');
H(/^tip:checklist: try /i, '✅ Checklist button', 'Opens or runs the thing this checklist line is about, so you can try it (a practice battle, a pretend chat, the right settings…). Tick the box on the left once it works.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:show the tests for |^tip:show every test on one page/i, '🗂️ Test categories', 'Tabs down the left side, like Settings: each one shows just that group of tests (the number = how many cards are in it). 📋 All tests shows every test on one page. Keys: [ and ] go to the category above / below.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:show the checklist part: |^tip:show the whole checklist/i, '🗂️ Checklist parts', 'Tabs down the left side of the checklist: 🤖 Test all (what it checked and how it went), ⚙️ Set up, 🆕 Recently updated and each group of things to try. 📋 Everything shows the whole checklist on one page.', ['test']);
H(/^🤖 test all$|^tip:check everything movie royal can check by itself/i, '🤖 Test all', 'Checks everything Movie Royal can check by itself, in the background: your Twitch, Discord, 24/7 bot, OBS, movie search and other connections, a battle on every map in a hidden test screen (nothing on stream), every finisher, the ban + series rules (and that the 24/7 bot\'s copy gives the same answers), your saved data and more. Nothing goes on stream, in chat or in Discord, and nothing is changed. The list ticks them off as they finish (✅ fine, ❌ a problem with what to do, 🟡 worth a look, ⚪ skipped because it isn\'t set up), and anything on the checklist it covers gets ticked too. You can keep using Movie Royal while it runs.', ['test']);
H(/^🤖 test all not done$|^tip:only the checks that haven't passed yet/i, '🤖 Test all not done', 'Like 🤖 Test all, but only the checks that haven\'t passed yet (❌, 🟡, ⚪ or never run), and skips checks whose checklist item is already ticked. Quicker after you fixed something.', ['test']);
H(/^⏹ stop testing$/i, '⏹ Stop testing', 'Stops 🤖 Test all after the check it\'s on. What it already checked stays in the list.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:.*'s special power$/i, '🗺️ Map power', 'This map\'s own special power (each map has one: Black Hole on Deep Space, Eruption on Lava Lake, Rain Shower on the Grand Prix…). It only shows while that map is up. Press it yourself for free, or link it to a channel point reward or a bits amount like any other power. Pressed before the fight, it waits and hits when the fight starts.');
H(/^🧍 characters instead of balls$/i, '🧍 Characters instead of balls', 'This battle shows characters instead of balls: little people whose head is the movie poster, your picture, the text, or the Twitch picture, with men, women and non-binary bodies (chat picks theirs with !id). Unticked = balls.');
H(/^🛡️ shield saves them once|^💪 mega ball big and heavy|^👻 ghost nobody can bump|^🦔 spiky bumping them hurts|^🧲 magnet pulls everyone close/i, '💜 One power-up on/off', 'Ticked = chat can buy this power-up with channel points during a fun chat battle. Unticked = its reward stays switched off on Twitch and nobody can buy it.');
H(/^use these$/i, '🌐 Use these links', 'Reads this battle\'s IMDb / Rotten Tomatoes links again (in order) with the number of movies you picked, and updates the battle: new movies come in, ones that dropped off leave.');
H(/^🏁 survival race \(figure 8/i, '🏁 Survival race (lab)', 'Test lab: on the Figure 8 and the mayhem races, cars that get wrecked are out (the last one driving wins) instead of everyone racing to the line.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:every part with its number|^🌐 parts website$/i, '🌐 Parts website', 'Opens the page with every character part and its number (hair, outfits, makeup, facial hair, bodies, colors, accessories): the same website Discord links to through your 24/7 bot. Tap parts to try them on and copy the /character command.');
H(/^▶ try it$/i, '▶ Try it', 'Runs this test (a practice battle or pretend thing: your real lists and settings stay the same).', ['test']);
H(/check it for nudity and warn me|^🔞 nudity heads-up$/i, '🔞 Nudity heads-up', 'When a movie wins, Movie Royal reads its IMDb Parents Guide ("Sex & Nudity") and TMDB\'s tags. If it has nudity, the Winner card shows it in red with every scene it found and about when it is (an exact time when people wrote one, otherwise "near the start" / "near the end" / "time not listed"). Orange = sex scenes but no nudity listed. The winner pop-up on stream just says "This movie has nudity" (no times, 📺 switch); it\'s never typed in Twitch chat. Off = no check.');
H(/also say it on the winner pop-up on stream/i, '📺 Nudity on the stream pop-up', 'On = the winner pop-up on stream gets a red line: "🔞 This movie has nudity" (no times: those are only on the Winner card in the app). Off = only the Winner card shows it. It\'s never typed in Twitch chat.');
H(/^🔞 heads up: this movie has nudity|^💋 sex scenes \(no nudity listed\)|^🔞 no nudity found|^🔞 couldn't check this one|^🔞 checking for nudity/i, '🔞 Nudity warning', 'Red = the movie has nudity: each line is one scene from the IMDb Parents Guide with about when it is in the movie (like "~1 h 12 min in" or "at 1:12:30"; "time not listed" = whoever wrote it didn\'t say). Orange = sex scenes but no nudity listed. The pop-up on stream just says the movie has nudity (no times); it\'s never typed in chat. Turn it off in Settings → 🎬 Movie info.');
H(/^tip:a practice round whose winner gets a pretend nudity|^⚔️ practice battle$/i, '⚔️ Practice battle with nudity', 'A practice round (nothing is saved) whose winner gets a pretend nudity result: the red warning shows on the Winner card here (every scene, with about when) and as "This movie has nudity" on the winner pop-up on stream.', ['test']);
H(/^🧪 pretend one$/i, '🧪 Pretend nudity check', 'Shows the red nudity warning for a made-up movie (no internet): what the Winner card shows when a movie with nudity wins.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:look this movie up for real|^🔍 check a movie$|^a movie name, like titanic/i, '🔍 Check a movie for nudity', 'Type any movie and it does the real check (IMDb Parents Guide + TMDB, needs your TMDB key): the same red warning the Winner card would show, with about when each scene is.', ['test']);
H(/^🧪 try the export$/i, '🧪 Export test', 'Makes the export file and reads it back like Import would, to show it all comes back. Nothing changes.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a pretend 🔄 refresh the whole banned list|^🧪 pretend whole refresh$/i, '🧪 Pretend whole refresh', 'Runs 🔄 Refresh the whole banned list with made-up movies (no internet), so you can watch it go. Your own bans stay the same. "Remove pretend bans" takes the made-up ones off again.', ['test']);
H(/^🍀 luck$/i, '🍀 Luck settings', 'Every luck setting in one place: luck on/off and how much per battle, wildcard spot luck, 👀 watch luck for each battle, saving / resetting / bringing back luck, and chat calling the winner.');
H(/^👀 watch luck$/i, '👀 Watch luck', 'People who watch your streams get extra luck in a battle. Off by default, set per battle with the 👀 Watch luck buttons below. When it\'s on, it\'s just added into their luck.');
H(/^👀 who has watch luck$/i, '👀 Who has watch luck', 'Shows everyone in this battle with how many hours they watched and how much watch luck they have now. You can also change the settings and start counting again from now there.');
H(/^tip:turn watch luck on or off for this battle|^👀 watch luck (on|off)$/i, '👀 Watch luck on / off', 'Turns watch luck on or off for this one battle, right away. Turning it on starts counting watched hours from now. Off by default.');
H(/^tip:how many hours someone has to watch to get one step of watch luck/i, '👀 Every … hours', 'How many hours someone has to watch your streams for one step of watch luck in this battle (10 = every 10 hours). Saves right away.');
H(/^tip:how much luck each step of watch luck gives/i, '👀 … gives this much luck', 'How much luck (%) each step of watch luck gives in this battle (1 = +1%). Saves right away.');
H(/^🎯 each battle: 👀 watch luck|^💾 save, reset and bring back luck/i, '💾 Luck for each battle', 'Every battle\'s watch luck switch (and how much), plus 💾 save, ↺ reset and 📂 bring back. Battles that aren\'t Discord movie battles have odds instead of luck.');
H(/^tip:watch luck: people who watch/i, '👀 Watch luck', 'Per battle, off by default. Every 10 hours someone watches your streams (you can change it) gives them +1% luck (you can change that too) in this battle, counted from the moment you turn it on. The window shows who has how much right now.');
H(/turn on watch luck for this battle/i, '👀 Watch luck on/off', 'Turns watch luck on or off for this one battle. Turning it on starts counting watched hours from now.');
H(/^tip:how many hours someone has to watch/i, 'Every … hours', 'How many hours someone has to watch your streams to get one step of luck (10 to start).');
H(/^tip:how much luck each step gives/i, '… this much luck', 'How much luck each step gives, in % (1 to start; all together it never goes over 100).');
H(/^tip:start counting watched streams again/i, '↺ Count from now', 'Starts counting watched hours again from right now (everyone starts over).');
H(/^tip:run a monster mash ball battle/i, '🦖 Monster Mash (balls)', 'A practice ball battle on Monster Mash: two giant monsters fight in the streets; their punches, fire breath and tail swipes smash the rooftops, and that part of the building collapses.');
H(/^tip:run a monster mash card battle/i, '🦖 Monster Mash (cards)', 'A pretend card battle on Monster Mash. Your Card pool doesn\'t change.');
H(/^tip:run a hero city test/i, '🦸 Hero City test', 'A practice battle on Hero City, with all five villains: the robot fist, the laser drone, Gloom, 🏗️ Wrecker\'s wrecking ball and 💣 Bombshell\'s bombs.');
H(/^tip:run a haunted graveyard ball battle/i, '🎃 Haunted Graveyard (balls)', 'A practice ball battle on Haunted Graveyard: Ghosts scare pieces into running for the edge; jack-o\'-lanterns drop and blow up.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a haunted graveyard card battle/i, '🎃 Haunted Graveyard (cards)', 'A pretend card battle on Haunted Graveyard: Ghosts scare pieces into running for the edge; jack-o\'-lanterns drop and blow up.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a new year.s eve ball battle/i, '🎆 New Year\'s Eve (balls)', 'A practice ball battle on New Year\'s Eve: Rockets burst on the pieces and the giant ball drops and smashes a hole in the roof.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a new year.s eve card battle/i, '🎆 New Year\'s Eve (cards)', 'A pretend card battle on New Year\'s Eve: Rockets burst on the pieces and the giant ball drops and smashes a hole in the roof.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a heartbreak island ball battle/i, '💘 Heartbreak Island (balls)', 'A practice ball battle on Heartbreak Island: Evil cupids shoot arrows; halfway through the heart breaks in two.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a heartbreak island card battle/i, '💘 Heartbreak Island (cards)', 'A pretend card battle on Heartbreak Island: Evil cupids shoot arrows; halfway through the heart breaks in two.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a leprechaun hills ball battle/i, '☘️ Leprechaun Hills (balls)', 'A practice ball battle on Leprechaun Hills: Evil leprechauns kick pieces toward the edge; the rainbow beam blasts across.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a leprechaun hills card battle/i, '☘️ Leprechaun Hills (cards)', 'A pretend card battle on Leprechaun Hills: Evil leprechauns kick pieces toward the edge; the rainbow beam blasts across.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a bunny rampage ball battle/i, '🐰 Bunny Rampage (balls)', 'A practice ball battle on Bunny Rampage: A giant evil bunny hops and stomps; painted eggs crack and blow up.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a bunny rampage card battle/i, '🐰 Bunny Rampage (cards)', 'A pretend card battle on Bunny Rampage: A giant evil bunny hops and stomps; painted eggs crack and blow up.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a fourth of july ball battle/i, '🎇 Fourth of July (balls)', 'A practice ball battle on Fourth of July: Bottle rockets skitter across the ground and firecracker strings go pop-pop-pop.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a fourth of july card battle/i, '🎇 Fourth of July (cards)', 'A pretend card battle on Fourth of July: Bottle rockets skitter across the ground and firecracker strings go pop-pop-pop.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a battle made from imdb and\/or rotten tomatoes/i, '🌐 IMDb / Rotten Tomatoes battle', 'Makes a movie battle from IMDb and/or Rotten Tomatoes lists, like the 500 worst movies. Pick the lists (or paste links), how many movies, and what to skip. It keeps reading further down the lists until it has that many.');
H(/rotten tomatoes: 100 worst movies|imdb: lowest rated movies|imdb: bottom 100/i, '🌐 Ready-made lists', 'Tick the lists the battle should read. It reads them in order (top first) until it has enough movies.');
H(/how many movies the battle keeps going|^tip:how many movies this battle keeps/i, '🌐 How many movies', 'The battle keeps reading the lists until it has this many movies (skipped ones don\'t count).');
H(/skip movies that aren.t in english/i, '🇬🇧 Skip movies not in English', 'Movies whose original language isn\'t English are skipped (TMDB says the language). The next movie on the list fills in.');
H(/skip sequels when i haven.t watched/i, '🎞️ Skip sequels', 'A movie in a series (TMDB\'s series list) only goes on this battle once you\'ve watched every movie in that series that came out before it (from Letterboxd, or won and watched in a Discord battle). Changing it reads the lists again.');
H(/^tip:someone pretends to pick one of the pretend imdb|^🎬 pretend a discord pick$/i, '🎬 Pretend a Discord pick', 'Pretend someone picked one of the pretend IMDb battle\'s movies in Discord: it leaves the battle and the next movie on the list takes its place. Your real Discord list doesn\'t change.', ['test']);
H(/picked in discord never go on it|left because someone picked them in discord/i, '🎬 Picked in Discord', 'A movie someone picked in Discord never goes on this battle. If someone picks one that\'s already on it (in Discord or with the 24/7 bot), it leaves this battle within a few seconds and the next movie on the list takes its place (once this battle isn\'t fighting).');
H(/skip movies (already )?on the discord movie list/i, '🎬 Skip movies on the Discord list', 'Movies someone already has on the Discord movie list are skipped, so the battle doesn\'t double up.');
H(/skip movies i.ve watched/i, '✅ Skip movies I\'ve watched', 'Movies you\'ve watched or rated on Letterboxd (from your Letterboxd name / files in Settings) are skipped.');
H(/^tip:read the lists again/i, '🔄 Update', 'Reads the IMDb / Rotten Tomatoes lists again: new movies come in, movies that dropped off (or that you\'ve watched since) leave. Odds you changed stay.');
H(/^tip:the imdb \/ rotten tomatoes links this battle reads/i, '🌐 Links', 'The IMDb / Rotten Tomatoes links this battle reads, one per line, in order. Any IMDb list, chart or search link, or a Rotten Tomatoes guide or browse page.');
H(/^other links \(optional, one per line\)/i, '🌐 Other links', 'Paste any IMDb list, chart or search link, or a Rotten Tomatoes guide or browse page (one per line). They\'re read after the ticked lists.');
H(/^tip:make a pretend imdb battle/i, '🌐 Pretend IMDb battle', 'Makes a test battle from 40 made-up movies (no internet): 3 aren\'t in English and 1 is on the Discord list, so you can see them get skipped and the battle still end up with 20.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: a ball battle/i, '🧪 Test lab: ball battle', 'Test a ball battle in the lab. It runs only in the lab screen on the Test tab: never on stream, nothing saved, nothing in chat or Discord.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: a card battle/i, '🧪 Test lab: card battle', 'Test a card battle in the lab with pretend packs (your Card pool doesn\'t change). Runs only on this page.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: which map/i, '🧪 Test lab: map', 'Which map to test. 🎲 Random picks one each time you press ▶ Run test.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: how many pieces/i, '🧪 Test lab: how many', 'How many balls (or card packs, up to 40) are in the test.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: how long the fight/i, '🧪 Test lab: fight length', 'How many seconds the fight should take (the pacer spreads the knockouts over it). Blank = your normal setting.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: countdown/i, '🧪 Test lab: countdown', 'Seconds of countdown before the fight starts (0 = right away).', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: what the pieces show/i, '🧪 Test lab: what\'s on the pieces', 'Made-up movies, numbers (like a number battle) or made-up chat names.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: how much luck/i, '🧪 Test lab: luck', 'How much luck the test pieces get, to see the luck glow and how luck changes the odds.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: laps/i, '🧪 Test lab: laps', 'How many laps the races (Figure 8 + the race maps) take in the test.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: survival race/i, '🧪 Test lab: survival race', 'Makes the Figure 8 test (or a mayhem race: ✖️ 🌋 🚧 🚀) a survival race: last one running wins.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: the elimination pacer/i, '🧪 Test lab: pacer', 'How hard the pacer works to spread the knockouts over the whole fight (0 = off).', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab power-up/i, '🧪 Test lab: power-ups', 'Ticked power-ups are given to every other piece in the test.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab wacky/i, '🧪 Test lab: wacky settings', 'Ticked wacky settings are on for the test battle (like a fun battle).', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab card wacky/i, '🧪 Test lab: card wacky settings', 'Wacky settings for the test card battle. You can tick them during the fight too. Only for the lab: your real card battle settings don\'t change.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: run the test/i, '▶ Run test', 'Starts the test battle in the lab screen with the settings on the left. Press it again any time for a fresh one.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: stop the test/i, '⏹ Stop', 'Stops the test battle in the lab.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: skip ahead/i, '⏩ +5 s', 'Fast-forwards the test battle 5 seconds.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: skip to the end/i, '⏭ To the end', 'Fast-forwards the test battle to the winner.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: sound/i, '🔊 Lab sound', 'Turns the test lab\'s sound on or off.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: bigger screen/i, '⛶ Bigger', 'Makes the lab screen as wide as the page (press again to go back).', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab chaos/i, '🧪 Test lab: chaos events', 'Sets off this chaos event in the test battle right now (✨ Map power = the map\'s own special power).', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: give a random piece/i, '⚡ Random power-up', 'Gives a random piece in the test battle a random power-up.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab race power-up/i, '🏁 Test lab: race power-ups', 'Fires this race power-up on a random racer in the test race (only on race maps): 💨 Boost, 🛡️ Shield, 🛢️ Drop oil, 🚀 Rocket straight ahead, or ☢️ Nuke (the 15-second cut scene where everyone else is wiped out).', ['test']);
H(/^tip:start a practice race with race power-ups/i, '▶ Start a test race', 'A practice race on the race map picked next to it, with 12 made-up racers and race power-ups on, so no winner is picked ahead of time. Then use the buttons under it to fire power-ups.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:which race map for the test race/i, '🏁 Test race map', 'Which race map the test race uses.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:race test:/i, '🏁 Race power-up test', 'Fires this race power-up on a random racer in the race on stream (start a test race first). ☢️ Nuke plays the whole 15-second cut scene.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run an elemental wizards ball battle/i, '🔮 Elemental Wizards (balls)', 'A practice ball battle on Elemental Wizards: four wizards on giant pillars take turns casting. 🔥 Fire blows pieces up, 🌊 Water sends a tidal wave that washes pieces toward the edge, 🪨 Earth drops a boulder that breaks the ground away, ❄️ Ice freezes pieces solid (if they are still frozen when it wears off, they shatter). Each spell shows where it will land first.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run an elemental wizards card battle/i, '🔮 Elemental Wizards (cards)', 'A pretend card battle on Elemental Wizards, same four wizards and spells.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a pompeii ball battle/i, '🌋 Pompeii (balls)', 'A practice ball battle on Pompeii: a long Roman town running downhill to the sea. The lava pours in at the top and chases everyone down through the streets, a little faster than anyone can run, and the screen scrolls down with the chase. Buildings block everyone. Nobody outruns it: the last one left wins.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a pompeii card battle/i, '🌋 Pompeii (cards)', 'A pretend card battle on Pompeii, same lava chase down the town.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a santa's workshop ball battle/i, "🎅 Santa's Workshop (balls)", 'A practice ball battle on Santa\'s Workshop: herds of evil reindeer stampede across (a red stripe shows where first) and a giant evil Santa locks on and fires lasers out of his eyes.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a santa's workshop card battle/i, "🎅 Santa's Workshop (cards)", 'A pretend card battle on Santa\'s Workshop, same reindeer and eye lasers.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a turkey trouble ball battle/i, '🦃 Turkey Trouble (balls)', 'A practice ball battle on Turkey Trouble: evil turkeys chase everyone and peck them toward the edge, and Turkey Trot flocks (orange stripe first) knock pieces off.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a turkey trouble card battle/i, '🦃 Turkey Trouble (cards)', 'A pretend card battle on Turkey Trouble, same evil turkeys.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:run a zombie horde ball battle/i, '🧟 Zombie Horde (balls)', 'A practice ball battle on Zombie Horde: zombies come out of the manholes and the street ends and chase everyone. Balls that get bitten take damage; too many bites and they\'re eaten.');
H(/^tip:run a zombie horde card battle/i, '🧟 Zombie Horde (cards)', 'A pretend card battle on Zombie Horde: a card that gets bitten is INFECTED: it\'s out, but it stays on the map as a zombie and chases the others. Your Card pool doesn\'t change.');
H(/^tip:turn this one power-up on or off/i, '💜 One power-up on/off', 'Ticked = chat can buy this power-up with channel points during a fun chat battle. Unticked = its reward stays paused on Twitch and redeeming it does nothing. 🛡️ Shield saves them once · 💪 Mega ball is big and heavy · ⚡ Turbo is faster · 👻 Ghost can\'t be bumped for the first 10 seconds · 🦔 Spiky hurts whoever bumps it · 🧲 Magnet pulls everyone close.');
H(/^tip:turn every wacky effect off/i, '✕ All wacky off', 'Turns every wacky effect off for chat battles.');
H(/^tip:try a pretend chat battle with what/i, '🧪 Try it', 'Runs a pretend chat battle with 10 made-up players: the wacky effects you ticked are on, and half of them have a power-up (only the ones ticked). Your real chat battle isn\'t touched.');
H(/slippery: the ground is ice/i, '🧊 Slippery', 'Fun chat battles: the ground is slippery ice the whole battle.');
H(/swap-o-rama/i, '🔀 Swap-o-rama', 'Fun chat battles: every 10 seconds or so, everyone swaps places at random.');
H(/speedy: every ball has turbo/i, '💨 Speedy', 'Fun chat battles: every ball gets turbo (faster, harder hits).');
H(/googly eyes on every ball/i, '👀 Googly eyes', 'Fun chat battles: every ball gets a pair of wobbly googly eyes that look where it\'s going.');
H(/^tip:put the new \/ updated tags back on every/i, '↺ Reset all map tags', 'Puts 🔴 NEW (or 🔵 UPDATED, for a map changed in an update) back on every ball and card map, like they were never played on stream. Works while you\'re live too.');
H(/^tip:put the new \/ updated tag back on this map/i, '↺ Reset this map\'s tag', 'Puts 🔴 NEW (or 🔵 UPDATED) back on just this map, e.g. if it got played on stream by mistake.');
H(/^tip:run the whole doomsday for real/i, '☠️ Run the whole Doomsday', 'The full Doomsday for real: the Doomsday screen on stream, your mic and camera off in OBS, and if you\'re LIVE your stream ends 15 seconds later. Live = a big warning pops up first and its button only works after 5 seconds (the real Doomsday never asks). Not live = a rehearsal: the screen, mic + camera off for 15 seconds, then back on. Either way your mic and camera come back on once it\'s over.');
H(/^tip:end my stream with the doomsday/i, '☠️ Yes, end my stream', 'Runs the Doomsday test while you\'re live: your stream really ends 15 seconds later. It can only be pressed after 5 seconds.');
H(/no, keep streaming/i, '✋ No, keep streaming', 'Closes the warning. Nothing happens.');
H(/^tip:change how test battles go/i, '⚙ Test battle settings', 'Opens the settings for the Test tab\'s practice battles: how many pieces, which map, the countdown, the fight length, the pacer, Figure 8 laps, and whether the pieces get luck. Only test battles use them; blank boxes use your normal settings. Saved on this computer.');
H(/^tip:how many made-up pieces fight/i, 'How many pieces', 'How many made-up pieces the practice battle has (2 to 1000).');
H(/^tip:which map the practice battle uses/i, 'Test battle map', 'The map the ⚔️ Ball battle and 🔢 Number battle tests use (the Derby and Figure 8 boxes always use their own map).');
H(/^tip:seconds of countdown before the test battle/i, 'Test countdown', 'Seconds of countdown before the practice battle starts. Blank = your normal countdown (Settings → Game).');
H(/^tip:how long the test fight lasts/i, 'Test fight length', 'How long the practice fight lasts. Blank = your normal fight length.');
H(/^tip:how hard the knockouts are spread over the test fight/i, 'Test pacer', 'The elimination pacer for practice battles (0 = off). Blank = your normal pacer.');
H(/^tip:how many laps the test figure 8/i, 'Test laps', 'How many laps the practice Figure 8 Race goes. Blank = your normal lap count.');
H(/give the pieces some luck/i, '🍀 Test luck', 'On = the practice pieces get different amounts of luck, so you see the glow and flames (and buses get luck health, speed and cow catchers). Off = no luck at all.');
H(/^tip:put the test battle settings back/i, '↺ Start over', 'Puts the test battle settings back to how they came (12 pieces, random map, your normal settings, luck on).');
H(/^tip:save and run a test ball battle/i, '▶ Save + run', 'Saves the test battle settings and runs a practice ball battle with them right away.');
H(/^❓$|#helpModeBtn/, '❓ Help mode', 'Turns help mode on. While it is on, clicking anything shows what it does instead of doing it. Press ❓ again or Esc to stop.');
H(/sign in with twitch|^sign in( again)?$/i, 'Sign in with Twitch', 'Connects Movie Royal to your Twitch account so it can read chat, see channel points, bits and subs, reply in chat, pin messages and make channel point rewards. If something in chat stops working after an update, signing in again usually fixes it (new features sometimes need one more permission).');
H(/#liveTag|^(🔴 )?live|not live/i, 'Live status', 'Shows if you are live on Twitch right now. Some things only happen when you are live: channel point rewards turn on, picks and swaps can lock (if you picked that rule), streamer respins refill, and the NEW tag on maps goes away after you play them.');

// ───────── main tabs ─────────
H(/^⚔️ battle$/i, '⚔️ Battle tab', 'The main game. Pick which battle is playing, choose a map, start the fight, use chaos powers yourself, and see the list of everything on the cliff. Whatever you do here is what\'s on stream when the battle is showing.');
H(/^🎬 movie pool/i, '🎬 Movie Pool tab', 'All your battles (pools) and everything in them. Pick a battle on the left to see its entries, change odds, pause or remove things, add stuff, import from Wheel of Names, export a battle to share, and handle Kirb (wild) spots.');
H(/^🎲 chat battle$/i, '🎲 Chat battle tab', 'A battle where Twitch chat joins by typing !join. Open joining, wait for people, then start. Fun mode adds power-ups bought with channel points and silly effects like low gravity.');
H(/^🎁 giveaway$/i, '🎁 Giveaway tab', 'Run a giveaway as a battle: viewers type !enter, you choose who can enter and who gets extra odds, then a battle picks the winner. 🔁 Reroll picks again if the winner doesn\'t show.');
H(/^🎡 wheel(\s*🎁.*)?$/i, '🎡 Wheel tab', 'Your Wheel of Names replacement. Make wheels, set each spot\'s size, type and rules, spin it on stream, and let chat respin or move it with channel points. Being on this tab puts the wheel on stream.');
H(/^💬 chat$/i, '💬 Chat tab', 'Your Twitch chat inside Movie Royal, with badges and emotes. On the right: alerts (subs, bits, raids, follows, redeems, donations) and Find someone. Point at a message to see the person\'s profile, delete it, time them out or ban them.');
H(/^👥 people/i, '👥 People tab', 'Everyone who picked a movie or linked their Twitch in Discord. Add people by hand, give them movies, link their Twitch name, mark who\'s here tonight, give fresh picks, or import a whole old wheel. The number is how many people there are.');
H(/^📜 history$/i, '📜 History tab', 'Every battle you have run: who won, when, on which map. Search any movie or name. 👑 Who won what lists every movie each person has won, and 📋 Results shows the full finishing order of each round.');
H(/^🧪 test( ?⚠️ ?\d+)?( ?🆕 ?\d+)?$/i, '🧪 Test tab', 'A green 🆕 number means new things to try: they\'re at the top of ✅ Checklist. A red ⚠️ number on it means something went wrong: open ⚠️ Errors to see what. Try every feature without going live and without anyone in chat: fake chat, fake redeems, bits and subs, test battles that change nothing, the wheel, Discord checks, OBS. Also the ✅ Checklist and the ⚠️ Errors list.');
H(/^❓ help$/i, '❓ Help tab', 'The full instructions for Movie Royal, with a search box.');
H(/^⚙️ settings$/i, '⚙️ Settings tab', 'Everything you set up once: your account and updates, the game, Discord, luck, Twitch and channel points, movie info sites, OBS, banned movies, sounds and patch notes.');

// ───────── ⚔️ Battle tab ─────────
SECTION(null);
H(/^playing$|#listSel|#playSel/i, 'Playing', 'Picks which battle is on the cliff: your Discord movies, a custom battle, a chat battle, a giveaway or a number battle. Whatever you pick here is what fights when you press START.');
H(/\+ new battle/i, '➕ New battle', 'Makes a new battle (pool). Choose what goes in it: 🎬 movies you search for, 📝 any text, 🖼️ pictures, 💬 Twitch chat (!join) or 🔢 numbers. You can paste a list or a Wheel of Names link right away.');
H(/^🗺️ map$|^map$/i, '🗺️ Map', 'Picks the battle map. 🎲 Random gives a different map every battle (never the same one twice in a row). 🔴 NEW = never played on stream, 🔵 UPDATED = changed since you last played it on stream. Each map has its own dangers and its own map power. 🎉 Holiday maps (Christmas, Halloween, Easter…) are normal maps you can use any time: they\'re just listed together in their own section at the bottom.');
H(/chat vote/i, '🗳️ Chat vote', 'Shows 4 random maps on stream and chat votes by typing 1, 2, 3 or 4. Each viewer gets one vote and can change it. When time runs out the winning map is picked and announced. Change how long the vote lasts in Settings → Game. Press End vote now to finish early.');
H(/^🔀 shuffle$/i, '🔀 Shuffle', 'Before a fight: moves every piece to a random new spot on the cliff. Press it as often as you like. It doesn\'t change anyone\'s odds.', /battle/i);
H(/^⛶ fullscreen$/i, '⛶ Fullscreen', 'Makes the game fill your screen (handy if OBS captures your whole screen). Press Esc to get the buttons back. Settings → Game can make it go fullscreen by itself when a battle starts.');
H(/pop out/i, '🪟 Pop out', 'Opens the game (or the wheel) in its own window. Add that window to OBS as a Window Capture (with its audio) so the stream shows the game while you keep using Movie Royal.');
H(/^↺ reset entries$/i, '↺ Reset entries', 'Empties the battle that\'s on the Battle tab so you can start its list over. Chat battles and giveaways: everyone who joined comes off. Your own battles: every entry comes out. Nothing is deleted, only hidden (🎬 Movie Pool → Taken out → put them all back). The Discord movie battle can\'t be emptied here: it\'s everyone\'s picks.');
H(/^↺ reset( battlefield)?$/i, '↺ Reset battlefield', 'Clears the cliff and puts the pieces back fresh, like starting over. Use it if the cliff looks stuck or wrong. It doesn\'t delete anything from your battles.');
H(/comet/i, '☄️ Comet (chaos power)', 'A comet smashes into a random spot on the cliff, blasting pieces away and breaking the ground. Press it yourself for free, or link it to a channel point reward or a bits amount so chat can set it off. Pressed before the fight, it waits and hits when the fight starts.');
H(/edge collapse/i, '🪨 Edge Collapse (chaos power)', 'A chunk of the cliff edge breaks off, and anyone standing on it falls. It doesn\'t happen on maps where the ground never breaks (its reward is switched off while those maps are up).');
H(/earthquake/i, '🌋 Earthquake (chaos power)', 'The whole map shakes, bouncing every piece around and cracking the ground. Good for shaking up a fight that\'s gone quiet.');
H(/meteor shower/i, '🌠 Meteor Shower (chaos power)', 'A bunch of small meteors rain down all over the map, each one knocking pieces around and breaking a little ground.');
H(/gale/i, '🌬️ Gale (chaos power)', 'A strong wind blows across the map in one direction, pushing everyone toward one edge.');
H(/ice age/i, '🧊 Ice Age (chaos power)', 'The ground turns to ice for a while: everything slides and it\'s hard to stop.');
H(/tornado/i, '🌪️ Tornado (chaos power)', 'A tornado moves across the map, sucking pieces in, spinning them and throwing them out.');
H(/shockwave/i, '💥 Shockwave (chaos power)', 'A blast from the middle pushes every piece outward, toward the edges.');
H(/lightning/i, '⚡ Lightning (chaos power)', 'Lightning strikes a few spots: pieces there get blasted and the ground can break. Not on maps where the ground never breaks.');
H(/boulder/i, '🪨 Boulder (chaos power)', 'A big boulder rolls across the map, flattening everything in its path.');
H(/teleport swap/i, '🌀 Teleport Swap (chaos power)', 'Random pieces swap places with each other instantly. Someone safe in the middle can end up on the edge.');
H(/low gravity/i, '🪐 Low Gravity', 'Everything floats and slides further for a while (in Fun mode it lasts the whole battle). Hits send pieces flying.');
H(/poltergeist/i, '👻 Poltergeist (chaos power)', 'An invisible ghost shoves random pieces around for a few seconds.');
H(/^🎁 hidden reveal/i, '🎁 Hidden reveal (mystery spot)', 'Makes this spot a mystery: on the wheel it shows its normal words and picture (the cover). A mystery spot is an ⚡ auto spot: when it lands the round timer pauses until you press 🎡 SPIN, and nobody can respin it. When the wheel lands on it, a card pack with that cover pops up in Movie Royal and on stream. Click the pack (or press Enter): the top tears off and a card comes out showing the hidden words / picture. With a holiday app style on, the pack and card dress up for it.');
H(/hidden picture/i, '🖼️ Hidden picture', 'A picture on the card when the pack is opened (optional, with or without hidden words).');
H(/^tip:opens the card pack only here/i, '👀 Preview the mystery card', 'Opens this spot\'s card pack only here in Movie Royal (not on stream), so you can see how it looks.');
H(/open the card pack/i, '🎁 Open the card pack', 'Opens the mystery spot\'s card pack: the card shows the hidden words / picture here and on stream. Works even if you closed the pack without opening it.');
H(/^tip:click to open the pack|click the pack to open it/i, '🎁 Mystery card pack', 'Click the pack (or press Enter) to tear it open: the card inside shows what the mystery spot does, here and on stream.');
H(/close without opening|^✕ close \(here and on stream\)/i, '✕ Close the card pack', 'Closes the mystery card pop-up here and on stream. Closed without opening? 🎁 Open the card pack on the wheel\'s result opens it again.');
H(/^🎁 try a mystery card/i, '🎁 Try a mystery card', 'A pretend mystery spot: the card pack pops up here and on stream (pick a holiday look to try it). Click it to open it. Nothing on your wheel changes.');
H(/^tip:spins the wheel onto the first mystery spot|^🎡 land on my mystery spot/i, '🎡 Land on my mystery spot', 'Spins the picked wheel onto its first mystery spot (a spot with 🎁 Hidden reveal on), so you can try the real thing.');
H(/^tip:mystery card look/i, '🎨 Mystery card look', 'Which look the test card pack gets: your app style, normal, or a holiday.');
H(/dress up the wheel's mystery card packs|mystery card packs get the holiday look/i, '🎁 Holiday mystery packs', 'On (the default): when a holiday app style is on, the wheel\'s 🎁 mystery card packs and cards get that holiday\'s look on stream too (pumpkins and bats for Halloween, snowflakes and trees for Christmas…). Off = always the normal purple and gold pack.');
H(/^🎁 mystery$|^tip:hidden reveal: /i, '🎁 Mystery spot', 'This spot has a hidden reveal: a card pack pops up when the wheel lands on it. It\'s an ⚡ auto spot: the round timer pauses and nobody can respin it.');
H(/^🎁 mystery spot \(hidden reveal\)$|^🎥 obs switches|^📋 battle list, 🏁 race laps/i, '🧪 Test card', 'Buttons to try this feature.');
H(/^🎁 mystery spot reveal$/i, '🎁 Mystery spot reveal', 'A pretend mystery card pack, here and on stream. Click it to open it.');
H(/mystery/i, '🎲 Mystery (chaos power)', 'Sets off one random power. Nobody knows which until it happens.');
H(/^◀$/, '◀ Follow the previous piece', 'The camera locks onto the previous piece in the fight, like following a marble.');
H(/^▶$/, '▶ Play', 'Plays this sound so you can hear it.', /sound|settings/i);
H(/🎯 follow/i, '🎯 Follow', 'The camera locks onto a piece and follows it around. Press again (or Tab) to jump to the next piece, ◀ for the previous one. Click empty ground on the game to let go.');
H(/^tip:(follow a pack|follow the next pack|follow the previous pack)/i, '🎯 Follow a pack', 'Card battles: the camera locks onto a pack and stays with it (Tab does the same; ◀ / ▶ go to the previous / next pack). You can also click a pack on the fight. 🎥 Auto lets go.');
H(/^tip:see the whole map/i, '🗺️ Whole map', 'Card battles: zooms all the way out so the whole street or ring shows (same as the O key).');
H(/^🎥 camera$|^tip:camera: click a pack/i, '🎥 Card battle camera', 'The card battle has a camera like the ball battles. On its own it zooms in on where the packs are fighting (closer as fewer are left). Take over with these buttons, or on the fight itself: scroll to zoom, drag to move, click a pack to follow it, double-click for the auto camera. Keys on the game: Q / E zoom, WASD or the arrows move, Tab follows a pack, O whole map, R auto. Turn the auto zoom off with Settings → Game → Auto camera.');
H(/^🗺️$/, '🗺️ Whole map', 'Zooms the camera out to show the whole cliff (same as the O key).');
H(/🎥 auto/i, '🎥 Auto camera', 'Hands the camera back to the automatic camera, which zooms in as the cliff crumbles so the action stays big. Double-clicking the game does the same.');
H(/^[⬅➡⬆⬇]$/, 'Move the camera', 'Moves the camera that way during a battle (same as WASD or the arrow keys). Handy when the game is popped out.');
H(/^➖$|^➕$/, 'Zoom the camera', '➖ zooms out, ➕ zooms in (same as scrolling on the game, or Q and E).');
H(/start royal/i, '▶ START ROYAL', 'Starts the battle that\'s on the cliff: a short countdown, then the fight. The last piece standing wins. During the fight this button shows the time left. Change the countdown and fight length in Settings → Game.');
H(/join timer \+ chat vote|^⏳ join time/i, '⏱️ 2-min join timer + chat vote (Discord battle)', 'For the Discord movie battle. Starts a 2-minute join time: the board is reset, so only people who type in Twitch chat now get their movies on (plus any you put in yourself with ▶). A numbered list of every movie shows on the right of the battle screen with who picked it and their luck, and the bot tells chat to vote who wins by typing the number or the movie name. If their pick wins, they get extra luck on their own movies (Settings → the call-the-winner luck, 1% to start). When the 2 minutes are up nothing starts by itself: you press START ROYAL when you\'re ready. Click it again during the 2 minutes to cancel.');
H(/chat timer, then start|2-min chat timer/i, '⏱️ 2-min chat timer, then start', 'Gives chat 2 minutes to show up first. Discord movies hop on the cliff when their person types in Twitch chat, and chat battles fill up with !join. When the 2 minutes run out the battle starts by itself. Press it again to cancel.');
H(/movie picks (open|closed)/i, '🎬 Movie picks OPEN / CLOSED', 'Opens or closes Discord movie picks. While closed, /suggest in Discord (and the 24/7 bot) tells people picks are closed. Movies already picked stay in, and /mymovies and /list still work. Settings → 🤖 Discord & picks can close picks by itself while you\'re live.');
H(/points (on|off)/i, '⭐ Points ON / OFF', 'Turns channel point chaos on or off. Off also switches off Movie Royal\'s chaos rewards on Twitch, so nobody spends points by accident. Green = on, red = off.');
H(/bits (on|off)/i, '💎 Bits ON / OFF', 'Turns bits chaos on or off. When on, cheering the bits amounts you set in Settings → 💰 Rewards & prices → 💎 Bits → chaos sets off chaos powers in the battle.');
H(/^📣 show roll call on the game screen/i, '📣 Roll call on the game screen', 'On: roll call shows on the game screen (the battle browser source). Turn it off if you use the separate roll call browser source in the same scene, so it doesn\'t show twice.');
H(/^➕ add it to obs for me/i, '📣 Roll call browser source', 'Movie Royal adds a browser source called “Movie Royal roll call” (its own page, see-through until a roll call starts) on top of the OBS scenes you pick. Handy for scenes without the game screen, like your camera scene.');
H(/^👀 preview \(pretend roll call\)/i, '👀 Roll call preview', 'Opens the roll call page with a pretend roll call, so you can see how it looks. Nothing real happens.');
H(/^add it by hand instead/i, '📣 Add roll call by hand', 'How to add the roll call page to OBS yourself: a Browser source with the address shown, 1920 × 1080.');
H(/roll call/i, '📣 2-minute roll call', 'Everyone with a Discord movie gets 2 minutes to type in Twitch chat. Anyone who doesn\'t sits out for the rest of the night. Movie Royal suggests one after 3 winners in a row didn\'t claim their win.');
H(/^🔊 on$|^🔇 off$|^🔊 sound is on|^🔇 sound is off/i, '🔊 Sound on / off', 'Mutes or unmutes every Movie Royal sound (game and wheel). The volume sliders stay where they are.');
H(/sound effects \d+%|^🔊 sounds \d+%/i, 'Sound effects volume', 'How loud the sound effects are (bumps, explosions, the wheel ticking, winner fanfare). Changes right away.');
H(/music \d+%/i, 'Music volume', 'How loud the music is (battle music, countdown music). Changes right away.');
H(/save luck|save odds/i, '💾 Save luck / odds', 'Saves a copy of everyone\'s luck (or odds, in custom battles) right now, so you can bring it back later from 📂 Saved luck.');
H(/reset luck|everyone to 1/i, '↺ Reset luck / Everyone to 1', 'Sets everyone\'s luck to 0 (or everyone\'s odds to 1), for a few fair battles. What they had is saved first, so you can bring it back from 📂 Saved luck.');
H(/saved (luck|odds)|luck saves/i, '📂 Saved luck / odds', 'Your saved copies of everyone\'s luck or odds. Press Bring back on one to put it back. What you had just before is saved too, just in case.');
H(/hidden words \(on the card\)|^tip:hidden words for the test/i, '🤫 Hidden words', 'What the card says when the pack is opened. Only you see it here until the wheel lands on the spot.');
H(/^👀 roll call page \(pretend\)/i, '👀 Roll call page', 'Opens the roll call browser source page with a pretend roll call (nothing real happens).');
H(/^tip:shows the capture window like the 2-min join timer|capture window like the join timer/i, '📺 Capture window test', 'Shows the capture window in OBS like the 2-min join timer does, then hides it after 10 seconds. Needs a window picked in Settings → 🎥 OBS.');
H(/^🎥 open obs settings$/i, '🎥 OBS settings', 'Opens Settings → 🎥 OBS.');
H(/^📋 go to the battle list$/i, '📋 Battle list', 'Jumps to the list under the battle and puts you in its 🔎 search box.');
H(/^🏁 show me the laps box$/i, '🏁 Laps box test', 'Sets the map to 🏟️ Speedway Oval so the 🏁 Laps box shows on the right side of the Battle tab. Set your map back with 🗺️ Map.');
H(/^⚔️ practice round \(winner shows/i, '⚔️ Practice round', 'A pretend battle with made-up movies; the winner screen shows ⏱️ how long the movie is.');
H(/^⚪ ball battle: final showdown$/i, '⚪ Final showdown test', 'A practice ball battle with 3 pieces on the map you picked: one goes out right away, so you see the FINAL SHOWDOWN (the last two charge at each other). Nothing is saved.');
H(/^🃏 card battle: final fight$/i, '🃏 Final fight test', 'A pretend card battle with 3 packs on the map you picked: one goes out right away, then the FINAL FIGHT: the 360° camera around the last two, the bell, the timed fight and a finisher. Nothing changes in your Card pool.');
H(/^🧍 characters: final fight$/i, '🧍 Characters final fight test', 'The same FINAL FIGHT with 🧍 characters instead of card packs (a practice round, nothing saved).');
H(/^tip:which ball map for the final showdown|^tip:which map for the final fight/i, '🗺️ Test map', 'Which map the final showdown / final fight test uses.');
H(/^☠️ doomsday \(screen only\)$/i, '☠️ Doomsday screen', 'Shows the Doomsday screen on stream for a few seconds. Nothing in OBS is touched.');
H(/^☠️ whole doomsday \(obs too\)$|^tip:the whole doomsday: the screen/i, '☠️ Whole Doomsday', 'The real thing: the Doomsday screen, your mic and camera off in OBS for 15 seconds, then back on. If you\'re live it asks first, because it ends the stream.');
H(/^💧 hydrate$|^🙆 stretch$|^🎩 pick a hat$|^🎉 viewer's choice$/i, '🎁 Reward scene', 'Pretends test_viewer redeemed it, so you see its pop-up (💧 🙆 🎩 here in Movie Royal) or the 🎉 confetti on stream. A reward that is switched off says so instead.');
H(/^🚀 raid: pick a stream$/i, '🚀 Raid pick test', 'Pretends a viewer redeemed the raid reward and typed a channel: the raid box pops up at the top. It only raids if you press it there.');
H(/^🎬 scenes$/i, '🎬 Scenes', 'One button for each big moment on stream: final showdowns, the mystery card, Doomsday, and the channel point reward pop-ups.');
H(/show what they typed on the pop-up/i, '💬 Show their pick', 'Off (the default): the 🎉 Viewer\'s choice pop-up only shows who redeemed it, and their pick stays a secret: they tell you later. On: it also shows what they typed. Changing it updates the reward\'s message on Twitch (if Movie Royal made the reward) and the OBS source.');
H(/^🍀 show the answers$|^tip:whose movies to show/i, '🍀 !mymovies test', 'Shows what this person would get back from !mymovies in Twitch chat, /mymovies in Discord and the ☁️ 24/7 bot, with every movie\'s luck. Nothing is sent to Twitch or Discord.');
H(/^👤 open their profile$|tip:opens this person's profile: the 🎬 movies/i, '👤 Profile luck test', 'Opens this person\'s chatter profile. Its 🎬 Movies part lists each movie with its 🍀 luck (own luck plus 👀 watch luck).');
H(/^🍀 !mymovies and \/mymovies with luck$/i, '🍀 !mymovies test', 'Try what people see when they check their movies, with the luck of every movie.');
H(/^🏁 laps for this race/i, '🏁 Laps for this race', 'Shows when the next battle is on a race map. Pick how many laps the race is before you press Start (− / + or type a number). It is the same setting as Settings → Game → 🏁 Races: how many laps, so every race map uses it.');
H(/allow movies that have an english dub/i, '🗣️ Allow dubbed movies', 'With 🌍 Not in English on, movies that likely have an English dub are allowed anyway: cartoons, anime, and well-known movies (at least the number of TMDB votes in the box below). TMDB doesn\'t list dubs, so this is a guess: small foreign movies still get banned. Turning it on (or changing the number) checks the movies the rule banned before and takes the dubbed ones off the list. Bans you made by hand stay.');
H(/well-known = at least/i, '🗣️ Well-known = at least … TMDB votes', 'How many votes a foreign movie needs on TMDB to count as well-known (so it likely has an English dub). Lower = more foreign movies allowed. Default 1000.');
H(/^🗣️ try dubbed movies$/i, '🗣️ Try dubbed movies', 'Adds three pretend “not in English” bans (an anime, a famous foreign movie, a small foreign movie), checks them again like the real update does, then removes them. No internet needed.');
H(/^🎥 let movie royal use obs/i, '🎥 Let Movie Royal use OBS', 'The main switch for everything Movie Royal does in OBS. Off = Movie Royal never connects to OBS (the Doomsday screen still shows, but nothing in OBS is touched), and it takes out what it added (the capture window, the celebration and roll call sources).');
H(/^☠️ when the void swallows the wheel/i, '☠️ Doomsday in OBS', 'When the void fills the wheel: Movie Royal mutes your mic, hides your camera and ends the stream 15 seconds later, then turns the mic and camera back on once the stream is over. Off = only the Doomsday screen shows.');
H(/^☠️ show the doomsday screen only/i, '☠️ Doomsday screen only', 'Shows the Doomsday screen on stream for a few seconds. Nothing in OBS is touched.');
H(/^🎥 test mic \+ camera off/i, '🎥 Test mic + camera', 'Turns your mic and camera off in OBS for 5 seconds, then back on, to check Movie Royal can reach them.');
H(/^📺 capture window: a window from your pc/i, '📺 Capture window on / off', 'Lets Movie Royal show a window from your PC (your browser with a YouTube video, a game…) small in the top-left of your stream. Off = the 📺 button on the Battle tab goes away and Movie Royal hides the window in OBS.');
H(/^⚙ set it up \(window \+ size\)/i, '⚙ Capture window setup', 'Pick which window shows (OBS lists your open windows), how big it is, and when it shows and hides by itself.');
H(/^👀 show it now$|^🙈 hide it now$/i, '📺 Show / hide now', 'Shows or hides the capture window on stream right now.');
H(/show it by itself during the 2-min join timer/i, '⏱️ Capture window during the join timer', 'On: when you press ⏱️ 2-min join timer, the capture window shows on stream by itself (small, top-left) so people have something to watch, and it hides when the battle starts (or when you cancel the timer). Needs a window picked.');
H(/always hide it when a battle starts|^hide it when the battle starts/i, '🙈 Hide when a battle starts', 'On: the capture window always hides when a battle starts, even if you turned it on yourself. (When it came on by itself for the join timer, it always hides at the start.)');
H(/^⏸ take it out of obs$|^🎬 change scenes$/i, '🎬 OBS source', 'Take it out of OBS (Movie Royal removes the browser source it added), or pick different scenes for it.');
H(/^🧪 try it$/i, '🧪 Try it', 'A pretend redeem, so you can see it work on stream.');
H(/^📋 copy$/i, '📋 Copy', 'Copies the address so you can paste it into OBS.');
H(/^☠️ doomsday$|^🎉 viewer's choice celebration$|^🖥️ the game screen$|^🔌 what movie royal may do in obs$/i, '🎥 OBS settings', 'Each box is one thing Movie Royal can do in OBS: switch it on or off, and set it up right there.');
H(/search a person or movie/i, '🔎 Search the battle', 'Type part of a person\'s name (Discord or Twitch) or a movie title. It searches everything in this battle, including the ones that aren\'t in it right now, so you can quickly check if someone made it in.');
H(/show the \d+ not in|only who.s in/i, '👀 Who\'s not in', 'The list shows only who is really in this battle (the pieces on the cliff, or in the battle that\'s running). This shows the rest too: movies sitting out, people who haven\'t typed in Twitch chat yet, and entries that didn\'t fit on the cliff.');
H(/^filter/i, 'Filter', 'Type part of a name or title to only show matching rows in the list.');
H(/reset wild spots/i, '🎟️ Reset wild spots', 'Brings back all the wild (Kirb) spots that were hidden because one of them won this week. Nothing is deleted when they\'re hidden, this just puts them back.');
H(/person \(name or twitch\)/i, 'Person (add by hand)', 'Type who picked the movie (their name or Twitch name). New people are added for you. Then type their movie in the next box and click it. Pick limits don\'t apply when you add by hand.');
H(/and their movie/i, '…and their movie', 'Start typing a movie title and click the right one in the list. It goes on the cliff for the person you typed in the first box.');
H(/^[−+＋]$/, '+ / − size', 'Makes this spot bigger or smaller by a set part of the whole wheel (10% by default, change it in ⚙️ Wheel settings). The other spots shrink or grow evenly to make room. On the void, only you and money can do this, never channel points.', /wheel/i);
H(/^−$|^\+$/, '+ / − odds', 'Changes this entry\'s odds. Bigger odds = a bigger piece = a better chance of winning. The number box shows the odds; you can type in it too.', /battle|pool|movie/i);
H(/^number$/i, 'Odds', 'This entry\'s odds. 1 is normal, 2 is twice the chance, and so on. Bigger odds also make its piece bigger.');
H(/^⏸️?$/, '⏸ Pause', 'Takes this off the cliff for now without deleting it. Press ▶ to put it back. On a hidden wild spot or benched movie, ▶ also skips the cooldown and the "has to chat first" check.');
H(/^tip:follow the next/i, '🎯 Follow the next piece', 'The camera locks onto the next piece in the fight, like following a marble (Tab does the same). ◀ goes to the previous one.');
H(/^▶️$/, '▶️ Play / preview', 'Plays or previews it so you can hear or see it before it\'s on stream.', /wheel|sound/i);
SECTION('The list under the battle');
H(/^▶️?$/, '▶ Put it back', 'Puts a paused, hidden or benched entry back on the cliff right away, skipping the cooldown and the "has to chat first" check.');
H(/^✕$/, '✕ Remove / close', 'Removes this entry (or closes this box). Removed movies can be picked again in Discord later.');
H(/^👤$/, '👤 Change who picked it', 'Moves this movie to someone else. Type a name: someone Movie Royal knows, anyone in your Discord, or a new name. Their /mymovies and !mymovies update and the bot posts it in Discord. Pick Nobody to make it your own pick.');
H(/^✅$/, '✅ Mark as watched', 'Marks the movie as watched: it leaves the pool and can\'t be picked again. The person gets a free replacement pick in Discord.');
SECTION(null);
H(/screen title/i, 'Screen title', 'Words shown at the top of the battle on stream, like "Spooky Movie Night". Empty = the battle\'s name. Each battle remembers its own.');
H(/start the next round by itself/i, 'Next round by itself', 'In a best-of series, the next round starts by itself a few seconds after each winner. Off = you start each round.');
H(/^how many rounds$|^rounds$|^one round$|^best of \d/i, 'Rounds (best of)', 'Makes it a series: best of 3, 5, 7 or 9. Whoever wins enough rounds first wins the whole thing. You start each round yourself, unless Settings → Game starts the next one by itself.');
H(/next round/i, 'Next round →', 'Closes the winner pop-up and puts the pieces back on the cliff for another battle.');
H(/start 30s claim timer/i, '⏱️ Start 30s claim timer', 'Gives the winner 30 seconds to type in Twitch chat to claim their movie. A pop-up on stream shows chat. If they type, the timer stops and you press ✅ Accept or ⏭️ Pass.');
H(/accept winner|^✅ accept/i, '✅ Accept winner', 'The winner showed up: their movie is the pick. It\'s marked watched, pinned in Twitch chat (if that\'s on) and counted as tonight\'s movie.');
H(/^⏭️ pass/i, '⏭️ Pass', 'Not tonight (they\'re late, it\'s too long…). Their movie goes back in the battle, they keep their luck and they aren\'t benched for the week.');
H(/they're here/i, '✅ They\'re here', 'Claims the win for them yourself, if you saw them in chat but Movie Royal didn\'t.');
H(/^↩️ not watching/i, '↩️ Not watching it, put it back', 'Undoes the win: the movie goes back in the pool and its luck comes back.');
H(/hide the pop-up/i, '✕ Hide the pop-up on stream', 'Hides the winner pop-up on stream. The winner still counts.');
H(/skip replay/i, '⏭ Skip replay', 'Skips the slow-motion replay and goes straight to the winner card.');
H(/stop the battle|^⏹ stop$/i, '⏹ Stop', 'Stops the fight with no winner. Nothing is saved.');

// ───────── 🎬 Movie Pool tab ─────────
SECTION(null);
H(/discord movies.*🎬|🎬 discord movies/i, 'Discord movies battle', 'Your main battle: every movie people picked in Discord with /suggest. The number is how many are in it. Click to see and change them.');
H(/💬 twitch chat\d*$/i, 'Chat battle (pool)', 'A battle filled by Twitch chat typing !join. Click to see who joined.');
H(/📝 text\d*$|🎬 movies\d*$|🖼️ pictures\d*$/i, 'A custom battle', 'One of your own battles. Click it to see what\'s in it and change odds, add or remove things.');
H(/add a movie yourself/i, 'Add a movie yourself', 'Start typing a title and click the right movie to add it to this battle.');
H(/a new week starts on/i, 'New week day', 'The day a new week starts: benched movies (people whose movie won) come back and the wild spots refill.');
H(/add the spots automatically/i, 'Add spots every week', 'Wild spots are added by themselves every new week.');
H(/^🗓️ new week$/i, '🗓️ New week', 'Starts a new week now instead of waiting for it: benched movies (people whose movie won) come back and the wild spots refill. It happens by itself on the day set in Settings → Discord & picks.');
H(/kirb spots|🎟️ spots|wild spots \(/i, '🎟️ Wild (Kirb) spots', 'Adds this week\'s wildcard spots to the pool by hand. If a wild spot wins, the others hide until the new week. The numbers show how many are in out of how many there should be. Rename them and change how many in Settings → Discord & picks.');
H(/lucy_tv|import everyone from your old wheel/i, 'Import everyone', 'Brings over your old wheel in one go: one person per line, like  lucy_tv: Heat, Coco, Jaws (1975). New people are made for you, and if they later use /suggest or /linktwitch in Discord it all joins up with their account.');
H(/commas or new lines|the thing 1982|paste a big list|^#bulk$/i, 'Add a list', 'Paste or type a list, separated by commas or new lines, then press Add all. Add x2, x3… after something to give it double, triple odds.');
H(/^add all$/i, 'Add all', 'Adds everything in the box above to this battle.');
H(/export this battle|^📤 export$/i, '📤 Export', 'Saves this battle (or wheel) as a file you can send to another streamer, pictures included. They open it with 📥 Import and get their own copy.');
H(/wheel of names share link|wheel of names link/i, 'Import a link', 'Paste a Wheel of Names share link (or a link to a list) and press Import link (or Get list) to bring every entry in, with odds if it has them. Trick that always works: on Wheel of Names click the entries box, press Ctrl+A, Ctrl+C and paste it in the list box instead.');
H(/^import link$|^get list$/i, 'Import link', 'Brings in the entries from the Wheel of Names link (or list link) you pasted.');
H(/^reset odds$/i, 'Reset odds', 'Sets everything in this battle back to normal odds (1).');
H(/^clear$/i, 'Clear', 'Empties this battle. Asks first.', /pool|movie/i);
H(/^lock now$|^unlock$/i, '🔒 Lock / unlock swaps', 'Stops (or allows) /swap in Discord. By default, picks and swaps lock by themselves only while a movie battle is going (Start → winner). Change that in Settings → 🤖 Discord & picks.');
H(/update the numbers/i, '🔢 Update the numbers', 'Changes a number battle\'s range (like 1 to 50). Numbers outside the new range are removed, missing ones are added, and numbers you keep keep their odds.');
H(/^from$|^to$|#nlFrom|#nlTo|#numFrom|#numTo/i, 'From / To', 'The first and last number in the number battle. Every number in between gets its own ball.');
