H(/ideas doc|leave ideas|docs\.google/i, '💡 Ideas doc link', 'A link in the pinned Discord message where people can leave ideas. Blank = no link.');
H(/countdown when you press start/i, 'Countdown', 'Seconds of countdown before the fight.');
H(/fight length/i, 'Fight length', 'How long the fight lasts before sudden death.');
H(/^tip:stop the pack search and search again/i, '🔄 Search again', 'Stops the pack search and runs it again with the same words.');
H(/^tip:stop the pack search \(/i, '⏹ Stop the search', 'Ends the pack search right away (handy if it seems stuck). Searching never takes more than about 30 seconds now; if it does, press this.');
H(/figure 8 race: how many laps|races: how many laps/i, '🏁 Race laps', 'How many laps every race goes: the Figure 8 Race and the 10 race maps (1 to 50). More laps = a longer race. The white flag comes out on the last lap.');
H(/^🚗 demolition derby$|^tip:run a demolition derby/i, '🚗 Demolition Derby test', 'A practice battle on the Demolition Derby map with 12 made-up school buses. Your lists and history don\'t change.');
H(/^🏁 figure 8 race$|^tip:run a (1-lap )?figure 8 race|^tip:run a figure 8 last bus/i, '🏁 Figure 8 Race test', 'A practice race with 12 made-up school buses. ▶ Run it uses your lap count, 1 lap is a quick one, and 💥 Last bus standing shows the rare race with no finish line.');
H(/max pieces on the cliff/i, 'Max pieces', 'The most pieces that fit on the cliff.');
H(/chat join command/i, 'Join command', 'What chat types to join a chat battle (!join).');
H(/fair winner|exact odds/i, '🎯 Fair winner', 'Every battle\'s winner is drawn by the odds before it starts (like a wheel, with luck counted in). The battle then plays out around that winner. Chaos, power-ups and wacky settings change the show, never who wins.');
H(/start the next round by itself/i, 'Next round by itself', 'In a best-of series, the next round starts a few seconds after each winner.');
H(/lists every chat command|^!moviesroyal$/i, '!moviesroyal command', 'The command that lists every chat command.');
H(/go fullscreen when a battle starts/i, 'Fullscreen on start', 'The game goes fullscreen when a battle starts (Esc to leave).');
H(/map vote length/i, 'Map vote length', 'How long the chat map vote lasts, in seconds.');
H(/cliff size/i, 'Cliff size', 'How big the cliff is on screen. 130 is normal.');
H(/auto camera — zooms/i, 'Auto camera', 'The camera zooms in as the cliff crumbles.');
H(/wheel of names api key/i, 'Wheel of Names API key', 'Only needed if a share link won\'t import.');
H(/instant replay/i, '🎬 Instant replay', 'Shows the last seconds again in slow motion before the winner card.');
H(/turn on luck/i, '🍀 Luck', 'Every battle a Discord movie loses makes it a bit more likely to win next time. It resets when that person\'s movie gets watched.');
H(/extra chance per battle/i, 'Luck per battle', 'How much luck a movie gets each time it loses (1% by default).');
H(/wildcard spots get luck/i, 'Wild spot luck', 'Wild spots also get luck when they lose (at most +1% per stream).');
H(/post in the discord movies channel when picks/i, 'Post when picks open / close', 'The bot posts in Discord when picks open or close.');
H(/let twitch chat call the winner/i, '🔮 Chat calls the winner', 'Viewers type !call and a movie before the fight. If they\'re right they\'re named in chat and their own movies get luck.');
H(/^chat command$|^!call$/i, '!call command', 'What viewers type to call the winner.');
H(/luck for calling it right/i, 'Luck for calling it', 'How much luck a right call gives their own movies.');
H(/tmdb token/i, 'TMDB token', 'For movie search, posters and years. Free from themoviedb.org.');
H(/omdb key/i, 'OMDb key', 'For Rotten Tomatoes and IMDb ratings on the winner screen. Free from omdbapi.com.');
H(/letterboxd username/i, 'Letterboxd username', 'Movie Royal reads your Letterboxd so movies you watched can\'t be picked.');
H(/obs address/i, 'OBS address', 'Leave it unless you changed the port in OBS.');
H(/obs websocket password/i, 'OBS password', 'From OBS → Tools → WebSocket Server Settings.');
H(/your mic in obs/i, 'Mic source', 'Your mic\'s name in OBS, for Doomsday and the OBS test. Press 🔌 Save & test the connection, then pick it from the list so the name matches exactly. Leave it empty and Movie Royal mutes every mic OBS has.');
H(/your camera in obs/i, 'Camera source', 'Your camera\'s name in OBS, for Doomsday and the OBS test. Pick it from the list after 🔌 Save & test the connection. Leave it empty and Movie Royal hides every camera OBS has.');
H(/save & test the connection/i, '🔌 Save & test', 'Saves and checks Movie Royal can talk to OBS.');
H(/sounds for/i, 'Sounds for', 'Which sounds you\'re changing: all maps, one map, or one wheel.');
H(/⬆️ upload/i, '⬆️ Upload', 'Use your own sound file for this.');
H(/what movies do i have|^!mymovies$/i, '!mymovies command', 'Viewers type it to see their movies (with each one\'s 🍀 luck) and picks left. Add a name to see someone else\'s.');
H(/cooldown per person/i, 'Cooldown', 'How often each person can use it.');
H(/free — viewers type !color/i, 'Ball colors: free', 'Viewers type !color pink to change their ball. Silent, 10-second cooldown.');
H(/channel points — adds one reward/i, 'Ball colors: channel points', 'Adds one reward, "Royal: Ball color", that viewers redeem and type a color.');
H(/off — everyone keeps/i, 'Ball colors: off', 'No color changes.');
H(/^!color$/i, '!color command', 'What viewers type to change their ball color.');
H(/post the winner in twitch chat/i, '🏆 Post the winner', 'Posts the winner in Twitch chat a few seconds after the replay.');
H(/pin the movie in twitch chat/i, '📌 Pin the movie', 'Pins the claimed movie at the top of Twitch chat: which movie of the night it is (#1, #2…), title, year, who picked it, and the movies you watched earlier tonight. The pinned Discord message lists tonight\'s movies too.');
H(/when the winner types in chat, stop/i, '✋ Winner answers in chat', 'When the winner types in chat, the claim timer stops and Movie Royal asks them in chat: !accept (watch it now) or !pass (save it for another night, they keep their luck). It does whatever they answer. The ✅ Accept / ⏭️ Pass buttons on the winner card are for doing it yourself.');
H(/watch it now. chat command|^!accept$/i, '✅ !accept command', 'What the movie winner types to watch their movie now.');
H(/not tonight. chat command|^!pass$/i, '⏭️ !pass command', 'What the movie winner types to save their movie for another night (it goes back in and keeps its luck).');
H(/sit out tonight|^!sitout$/i, '🛌 !sitout', 'Viewers type it to take their movies out of tonight\'s battles.');
H(/i.m back. chat command|^!imback$/i, '🙋 !imback', 'Puts their movies back in.');
H(/bits or more|\+ tier/i, 'Bits tiers', 'Which chaos power each bits amount sets off. + Tier adds one.');
H(/client id|client secret/i, 'Twitch app keys', 'From the Twitch developer console. The setup guide shows where.');
H(/channel to read chat from/i, 'Chat channel', 'Whose chat Movie Royal reads. Normally yours.');
H(/streamelements jwt|streamlabs socket/i, 'Donation token', 'So Movie Royal can see donations.');
H(/create my channel point rewards/i, '✨ Create rewards', 'Makes the chaos channel point rewards on Twitch.');

H(/black hole|eruption|blue shell|aftershock|laser grid|final smash|tag team|multiball|blizzard|mega bite|butter blast|worm frenzy|dragon raid|tremor|stampede|villain team-up|rat swarm|royal charge|mega bomb/i, '🗺️ Map power', 'This map\'s own special power (each map has one: Black Hole on Deep Space, Eruption on Lava Lake, Dragon Raid on Dragon Keep…). It only shows while that map is up. Press it yourself for free, or link it to a channel point reward or a bits amount like any other power. Pressed before the fight, it waits and hits when the fight starts.');
H(/^➕ add$/i, '➕ Add', 'Opens the boxes to add something to this battle by hand (for Discord movies: the person, then their movie).');
H(/^➕ add someone$/i, '➕ Add someone', 'Opens the boxes to add a person by hand.');
H(/pool & odds/i, 'Pool & odds', 'Everything in this battle with its odds. 🍀 luck is on = Discord movies get luck when they lose.');
H(/^who.s in \(\d+\)$/i, 'Who\'s in', 'Everyone who joined (the number). Click to show or hide the list.');
H(/one person per line: twitch name/i, 'Import everyone', 'Brings over your old wheel in one go: one person per line, like  lucy_tv: Heat, Coco, Jaws (1975).');
H(/^🎯 spots👤 who spun$/i, 'Stats view', 'Stats by spot, or by who spun.');
H(/^clear$/i, 'Clear errors', 'Empties the error history.', /errors/i);
H(/^→$/, '→', 'The old name goes on the left, the new name on the right.');
H(/^(?!text$|number$|checkbox$|color$)[a-z0-9_]{3,}$/i, 'Recent chatters', 'People who typed in Twitch chat this stream. Click a name to put their movies on the cliff (or link their Twitch name to their Discord).', /discord movies|📋/i);

H(/^tip:click, then press the new key/i, '⌨️ Change this key', 'Click it, then press the key you want (you can hold Ctrl, Alt or Shift too). Esc keeps the old one, Backspace turns it off. It saves right away. Each key only works on its own tab, and never while you\'re typing in a box.');
H(/^tip:put this one back/i, '↺ Put it back', 'Puts this key back to how it came.');
H(/put them all back/i, '↺ Put them all back', 'Puts every key bind back to how it came.');
H(/^⌨️ key binds$/i, '⌨️ Key binds', 'Keyboard shortcuts for each tab: Space spins the wheel, G starts the battle, Ctrl+H turns help mode on and off, Alt+1 to Alt+0 jump between tabs, and lots more. Change any of them here. Keys only work on their own tab and never while you\'re typing in a box.');
H(/^tip:open the preview in its own window/i, '⧉ Pop out the preview', 'Opens the preview of what\'s on stream in its own window, so you can drag it to another monitor. It has no sound (Movie Royal already plays it). Close that window to bring the preview back here.');
H(/preview window|bring the preview back here/i, '📺 Preview window', 'Shows or hides the little window with what\'s on stream right now. It pops up by itself only when you run a test that changes the stream screen.');
H(/^⧉ pop out to another monitor$/i, '⧉ Pop out the preview', 'Opens the preview of what\'s on stream in its own window, so you can drag it to another monitor. No sound. Close it to bring the preview back here.');

H(/check the backup link/i, '🛡️ Check the backup link', 'Leaves Movie Royal\'s notes in the hidden #movie-royal-sync channel right now and reads what the backup bot server said back. It tells you whether a Movie Royal Backup Bots app (yours or a friend\'s) is watching your Discord bot.');
H(/copy my bot token/i, '📋 Copy my bot token', 'Copies your Discord bot\'s token, so a friend can paste it into their Movie Royal Backup Bots app and run your bot as a backup. Whoever has it can fully control your bot: only give it to someone you trust, privately. You can reset it any time in the Discord Developer Portal.');
H(/keep a hidden <?code>?#?movie-royal-sync|#movie-royal-sync channel \(only the bot/i, '🛡️ Sync channel', 'A hidden channel only your bot can see. Movie Royal leaves notes there for a backup bot server: that it\'s open, your rules and pool, and it picks up movies the backup took while Movie Royal was closed. Needed for the Movie Royal Backup Bots app.');
H(/switch back to the cloud/i, '☁️ Switch back to the cloud', 'Your 24/7 cloud bot had problems, so a backup bot server took over your Discord bot. Press this once the cloud bot works again: Discord goes back to the cloud bot, and the backup stands by. Movie Royal never switches back by itself, so the bot doesn\'t bounce back to a broken cloud.');
H(/add my bot to the backup on this pc/i, '🛡️ Add my bot to the backup on this PC', 'One click: puts your Discord bot in the Movie Royal Backup Bots app on this same PC. No copying the token. The backup app has to be open.');
H(/add my bot from movie royal/i, '🍿 Add my bot from Movie Royal', 'In the backup app: takes the bot token straight from Movie Royal on this PC and adds your bot.');
H(/needs an update \(when movie royal opens\)|show the 24\/7 bot update pop-up/i, '🔔 24/7 bot update pop-up', 'When a new Movie Royal has changes for your 24/7 Discord bot on Cloudflare, a pop-up asks you to update it when Movie Royal opens (the bot on Cloudflare can\'t update by itself). Untick this to stop the pop-up; you can still update it here. The Test tab button shows the pop-up so you can see it.');
H(/when adding and swapping movies lock/i, '🔒 When picks and swaps lock', 'When Discord /suggest and /swap stop working by themselves. Default: only during a movie battle, from when you press Start until it has its winner, so people can add and swap right up to the start. Or: the whole time you\'re live, or never (only when you lock them yourself).');
H(/^📂 choose a file…$/i, '📂 Choose a file', 'Opens Windows Explorer so you can pick the wheel file: a Movie Royal wheel someone sent you, a Wheel of Names .wheel file, or a list (.json, .txt, .csv). It opens as a new wheel.');
H(/^import link$/i, '📥 Import link', 'Imports a wheel from a Wheel of Names share link.');
H(/^⬆ previous$|^⬇ next$/i, '⬆ Previous / ⬇ Next spot', 'Moves this settings window to the spot above or below in the list, so you can set up spots one after another.');
H(/resolution \(how sharp/i, '🖼️ Resolution', 'How many pixels the game screen is drawn with. 1080p is normal. Lower (720p, 900p) is lighter for your PC; higher (1440p, 4K) is sharper but heavier. The game always fits the screen the same way.');
H(/frame rate \(fps cap/i, '⏱️ Frame rate', 'Caps how many times a second the game is drawn. "Match my monitor" is the smoothest. A lock like 30 or 60 FPS saves power; 60 matches most OBS setups.');
H(/quality \(glows, particles/i, '✨ Quality', 'Low turns off glows and draws few particles (dust, sparks, confetti). Medium draws fewer particles. High is everything on.');
H(/show an fps counter|show the fps counter/i, '📈 FPS counter', 'Shows how many frames a second the game screen draws, its resolution and quality, in the top-left corner. Green = smooth, yellow = OK, red = struggling. It shows on stream too, so turn it off before going live.');
H(/^tip:while obs has the movie royal game screen open/i, '🔇 No double sound', 'When OBS has the Movie Royal game screen open (the battle / wheel browser source), the app\u2019s own game screen goes quiet, so you don\u2019t hear every battle and wheel sound twice (and the stream doesn\u2019t get it twice). The sound you hear then comes from OBS\u2019s browser source. Untick to have the app play them too. If you hear nothing at all, the OBS source has “Control audio via OBS” ticked: turn on Audio Monitoring for it in OBS\u2019s Advanced Audio Properties, or untick that box.');
H(/power saver for the game inside movie royal/i, '🔋 Power saver', 'The game inside Movie Royal keeps running on other tabs (it plays the sounds). It only starts the first time you open the Battle / Card battles / Marathon tab or a battle starts. With this on, it draws at a much lower resolution and frame rate while it\'s hidden (another tab, or Movie Royal minimized / covered by other windows) or in the small preview window, so the app stays snappy. What OBS shows isn\'t affected.');
H(/^🎨 graphics$/i, '🎨 Graphics', 'Resolution, frame rate cap, quality and an FPS counter for the game screen.');
H(/sign in as the bot|sign in again$/i, '🤖 Chat bot account', 'Connects a second Twitch account (for example MoviesRoyalBot) so Movie Royal\'s chat messages (winners, replies, hourly messages) come from the bot instead of you. Log in as the bot on the Twitch page (press “Not you?” if it shows your own account).');
H(/say hi in chat/i, '💬 Say hi in chat', 'The chat bot posts a hello in your Twitch chat, so you can see it works.');
H(/talk in chat as the bot/i, '🤖 Talk as the bot', 'Ticked: Movie Royal talks in chat as your bot account. Unticked: it talks as you.');
H(/chat message every|^📣 chat message/i, '📣 Chat message', 'One switch for every tab. Turning it on posts in Twitch chat right away, then again every hour (or what you set), until you turn it off or your stream ends. Each time, it posts the message for the tab you\'re on: Battle tab = how to add movies in Discord (your Discord link + the commands command), Chat battle / Giveaway = how to join, Wheel = how respins work. Want it posted right now? Turn it off and on again. ✏️ shows the message.');
H(/discord server invite link/i, '🔗 Discord invite link', 'Your Discord server\'s invite link. The hourly Battle tab message puts it in chat so viewers can join and add movies. Leave it empty and the Discord bot makes a never-expiring invite to your movie channel by itself.');
H(/how often \(minutes\)/i, 'How often', 'Minutes between the 📣 chat messages (at least 5). 60 = every hour.');
H(/^🎬 add a movie:?$|movie title \(like jaws/i, '🎬 Pretend viewer adds a movie', 'The viewer you\'re typing as adds this movie, as if they used /suggest in Discord and linked their Twitch name. It goes into the real Discord movie pool (picks rules and locks count). Type in chat as them to put it on the cliff. 🧹 takes all pretend movies out again.');
H(/only keep viewer stats/i, '🔗 Only track linked viewers', 'Viewer profiles only count chats, watch streaks and watch time for people who linked their Twitch to Discord with /linktwitch (and you). Chat messages are still saved for everyone, so the Chat tab and searching still work. Their profile shows the day they linked.');
H(/name tag at the start of movie royal/i, '🤖 Chat name tag', 'While Movie Royal talks in Twitch chat as you, every message it sends starts with this (default "🤖 Movies Royal Bot:"), so chat can tell the app said it. Empty the box for no tag. With a chat bot account signed in, the messages come from the bot and get no tag.');
H(/^tip:see \/ change the message$/i, '✏️ The chat message', 'Shows the hourly chat message for this tab, and takes you to where you can change its words.');
H(/^🧰 test tools$|^⚔️ battles$|^🎬 movie nights & discord picks$|^💬 twitch chat, channel points & bits$|^🎡 wheel$|^🤖 discord, 24\/7 & backup bots$|^🖥️ screen, sounds & the app$|^📋 other$/i, '🧪 Test categories', 'The tests (and the checklist) are sorted into groups. The tabs down the left side show one group at a time (📋 All tests / 📋 Everything shows them all).', /test/i);
H(/^✓ seen them all$|^✓ move them to their categories$/i, '✓ Move them to their categories', 'Moves everything in 🆕 Recently updated down to its own category (and takes the green number off the 🧪 Test tab). Each update puts its new things in 🆕 Recently updated again; ones you tick move to their category by themselves when you leave the tab.');
H(/^set it up$/i, 'Set it up', 'Takes you to the settings for this.');
H(/^add to list$/i, 'Add to list', 'Adds everything you typed or pasted in the box above to this battle (commas or new lines; x3 after one = triple odds).');
H(/^delete$/i, '🗑 Delete', 'Deletes this whole battle (asks first). The Discord movie battle can\'t be deleted.', /pool/i);
H(/^🤖 movies royal bot:?$/i, '🤖 Chat name tag', 'While Movie Royal talks in Twitch chat as you, every message it sends starts with this, so chat can tell the app said it. Empty the box for no tag.');
H(/^(⚔️ battle tab \(discord movie battle\)|🎲 chat battle tab|🎁 giveaway tab|🎡 wheel tab)$/i, '📣 Chat message words', 'The words the 📣 Chat message button on that tab posts in Twitch chat. Leave it empty to use the default (shown in grey). {discord}, {commands}, {join} and the others fill in by themselves.', /twitch/i);
H(/mute movie royal while i'm in another program/i, '🔇 Mute when not in the app', 'On by default: when you click into another program (a game, OBS, your browser…), every Movie Royal window goes quiet. Click back into Movie Royal and the sound comes back. The stream isn\'t affected (the game screen in OBS plays its own sound), unless you capture Movie Royal\'s window or desktop sound in OBS: then turn this off.');
H(/^tip:take it off the wheel/i, '✕ Take off the wheel', 'Makes the spot invisible: it leaves the wheel but stays in the list with all its settings (👁️ brings it back). Nothing is deleted. To delete a spot for good: ⚙ → 🗑 Delete for good.');
H(/^🗑 delete for good$/i, '🗑 Delete for good', 'Deletes this spot completely: its rule, size, picture and sound are gone. Its past wins stay in the wheel history. Asks first. (✕ in the list only makes a spot invisible.)');
H(/^💰 rewards & prices$/i, '💰 Rewards & prices', 'Every channel point reward, bits amount and donation amount in one place, sorted by tab: prices, when each reward is on, the raid and viewer rewards, reward names / cooldowns / what they do, and the 💎 Bits → chaos tiers.');
H(/^(📏 follow the rules|✅ always on|⏸ off \(hidden on twitch\)|1️⃣ on, then off after one use)$/i, '💰 When a reward is on', 'Follow the rules: Movie Royal shows it only while it can be used. Always on: it stays in the channel points menu. Off: hidden on Twitch until you change it back. On, then off after one use: someone redeems it once, then it hides. Always on / Off beat the rules.');
H(/^price$/i, '💰 Price', 'How many channel points the reward costs. Saved on Twitch right away (rewards made by hand on Twitch can only be changed on Twitch).');
H(/^⏸ pause/i, '⏸ Pause', 'Paused bits, subs or donations do nothing in Movie Royal until you untick it (the money still goes to you as normal).');
H(/respins per sub|respins per gift sub|bits gives respins|pop-up for donations|pop-up for bits from|^💎 every$/i, '💵 Wheel money amounts', 'How subs, gift subs, bits and donations count on the wheel: respins they give, and when the pop-up shows.');
H(/raid reward: a viewer redeems it|raid reward name on twitch/i, '🚀 Raid reward', 'A channel point reward: the viewer who redeems it picks who you raid. Movie Royal asks them in chat, they type a Twitch name, a pop-up celebrates it and a 🚀 box at the top of the app shows it: click it to start the raid. The reward hides for the rest of the stream once it\'s used. Movie Royal makes the reward itself: an old raid reward keeps its price (1500 if there was none).');
H(/make \/ fix the raid reward now/i, '🚀 Make the raid reward', 'Makes the raid reward on Twitch now (it happens by itself too). An old raid reward Movie Royal made is replaced with the same price; one made by hand has to be deleted on Twitch.');
H(/take winner out of the pool/i, '🚪 Take winner out of the pool', 'The winner of a custom battle leaves the pool (hidden, not deleted) so it can\'t win again (hidden, not deleted).');
H(/^add a movie \(or any text\)/i, 'Add a movie (or any text)', 'Type a movie name and click it in the list to add it to this battle. In a custom battle you can also add any text that isn\'t a movie: click 📝 Add as plain text (or press Ctrl+Enter).');
H(/^click to change it$/i, '✏️ Entry name', 'The name of this entry (text, numbers or pictures). Click it and type to change it; it saves when you click away.');
H(/stop battle/i, '⏹ Stop battle', 'Stops the battle that is running right now. Nobody wins and nothing is counted.');
H(/^⚔️ battle running/i, '⚔️ Battle running', 'A battle is going right now. Wait for it to end (or stop it on the Battle tab) before starting another.');
H(/.*/, '🃏 Card battle settings', 'Name this card battle, pick every pack or 1 of each, and tick which games fight (none ticked = every game).', /edit card battle|new card battle/i);
H(/.*/, '➕ Your own pack', 'The name, game, how many you have and a picture (a link, or 📂 choose a file) for a pack you add by hand.', /add my own pack/i);
H(/^⏹ stop it$/i, '⏹ Stop the pretend fight', 'Stops the card battle that is going.');
H(/^who's in$/i, '👥 Who\'s in', 'Everyone who entered the giveaway so far.');
H(/(every pack|1 of each)\d*$/i, '🃏 Your card battles', 'One of your saved card battles: click it to change its settings and see its packs. The number is how many fighters it has.');
H(/^tip:every free \(saved\) wheel spin given out/i, '🎟️ Free spins', 'Every free (saved) wheel respin: who got one and why (subs, bits, respins that came in at the same time, sneaky auto-spot respins, ones you gave), who used one, and any that went back because they couldn\'t spin. Newest first, plus who has saved spins right now. Use it to double-check things were done right.');
H(/^tip:how many seconds after a respin lands/i, '🔁 Respins at the same time', 'Only the first respin counts, always. Anyone else who redeems a respin (channel points or saved spins) while it\'s spinning, waiting to spin, or within this many seconds after it lands gets a free saved respin instead.');
H(/^tip:who.s spinning: pick from the people who chatted/i, '🎡 Who\'s spinning?', 'The name shown for this spin. Click the box (or start typing) to pick from the people who chatted most recently, newest first. Known bots (Nightbot, StreamElements, Streamlabs, your own chat bot…) are left out. Blank = you.');
H(/^tip:who gets the spins: people who chatted/i, '🎟️ Give spins: who', 'Who gets the saved spins. Click the box (or start typing) to pick from the people who chatted most recently (bots left out), then everyone who already has saved spins.');
H(/^tip:who paid for the grow/i, '📈 Grow: who paid', 'Who paid for the grow. Click the box (or start typing) to pick from the people who chatted most recently (bots left out).');
H(/auto \+ countdown/i, '⚡🔢 Auto + countdown', 'An ⚡ auto spot with a countdown. When it lands, the round timer pauses (do the thing, then press 🎡 SPIN) and one comes off its count. At 0 it leaves the wheel on the next spin. Like every auto spot, nobody can respin it.');
H(/auto \+ link/i, '⚡🔀 Auto + Link', 'An ⚡ auto spot that always links somewhere: when it lands, the round timer pauses and Movie Royal goes straight to the wheel, battle or card battle you pick under 🔀 (⚙ spot settings). Then it comes back.');
H(/⚪ ball · 🃏 card/i, '🗺️ Card battle map', 'Where the card battle is fought. ⚪ = a ball battle map, 🃏 = a card battle map, ⚪🃏 = both. Card fighters can use every map marked 🃏. 🎲 Random picks any of them each fight.');
H(/^⚪🃏 on a ball map$|card fighters on a ball map/i, '⚪🃏 Card fight on a ball map', 'Pretend packs fight on Lava Lake (a ball map) as card fighters. Nothing in your pool changes.');
H(/^tip:don't show these new steps/i, '🆕 Don\'t show again', 'Stops the pop-up about these new Setup guide steps. They stay in the 🧭 Setup guide (link in Settings) whenever you want them.');
H(/^tip:don't pop up about new versions/i, "Don't show again (updates)", "No more pop-up when a new version is out. You can still check for updates in Settings → 👤 Account & updates, and turn the pop-up back on there.");
H(/^tip:never ask this again \(nothing changes\)/i, "Don't show again", "Never asks this question again and changes nothing. The switch is in Settings → Game → 🧍 Characters.");
H(/^tip:never ask about holiday styles/i, "Don't show again (holidays)", "No more holiday style questions: the app style is set to Normal. Settings → App & background → 🎨 App style turns it back on.");
H(/^tip:don't show this one when movie royal starts/i, "Don't show again", "This new Setup guide step won't pop up again when Movie Royal starts. It's still in the 🧭 Setup guide.");
H(/^tip:asks again next time movie royal opens/i, 'Later', 'Closes this step. It asks again next time Movie Royal opens.');
H(/pop up when a new version is out/i, '🔔 Update pop-up', 'When on, Movie Royal asks to install a new version when it opens (in the start-up pop-up). Off = no pop-up; use 🔄 Check for updates yourself.');
H(/^remind me in a week$/i, 'Remind me in a week', 'The monthly backup reminder waits a week before asking again.');
H(/^tip:ask again next time movie royal starts/i, 'Later', 'Closes the pop-up. It shows again next time Movie Royal starts, until you open the Setup guide.');
H(/^tip:how many times it can be used each stream|countdown: x uses per stream/i, '🔢 Countdown rule', 'Pick 🔢 Countdown in “When it\'s on” and type how many times the reward can be used each stream. It stays on until it\'s been used that many times, then it\'s off (hidden on Twitch) until your next stream. The note shows how many are left.');
H(/^tip:start this stream's countdown over/i, '↺ Start the countdown over', 'Gives the reward all its uses back for this stream.');
H(/make \/ fix the viewer rewards/i, '🎁 Make / fix the viewer rewards', 'Checks your channel points for Hydrate, Stretch, a hat reward and Viewer\'s choice. One Movie Royal made is deleted and made again with the same name and price; one you made by hand on Twitch can only be deleted on Twitch (it still works meanwhile). Missing ones are made with a starting price you can change in the list below. They are always on in the menu.');
H(/hydrate, stretch and pick a hat show a pop-up/i, '💧🙆🎩 Viewer reward pop-ups', 'When someone redeems Hydrate or Stretch (or picks a hat), a pop-up with a sound shows for 5 seconds: a chugging sound for Hydrate, a stretching sound for Stretch. Only while Movie Royal is the window you\'re on, so it never pops up over your game.');
H(/hats viewers can pick/i, '🎩 Hat list', 'One hat per line. When someone redeems Pick a hat, the bot posts them in chat with numbers; the viewer types the number or the name, the bot says which hat they picked, and a pop-up shows it.');
H(/^🎬 pick the obs scenes$|^pick the scenes$|^🎬 pick the scenes$|^📺 put it in these scenes$|^🎬 which obs scenes/i, '🎬 Pick the OBS scenes', 'Lists your OBS scenes with tick boxes: the 🎉 Viewer\'s choice celebration goes on top of the scenes you tick and is taken out of the ones you don\'t. Tick all / Untick all help with lots of scenes.');
H(/put it on my stream|take it off my stream/i, '📺 Viewer\'s choice on stream', 'Off (paused) by default. Press it to add an OBS browser source called “Movie Royal celebration” on top of the OBS scenes you tick (it asks OBS for your scenes; needs OBS set up in Settings → 🎥 OBS). Then Viewer\'s choice plays the confetti, balloons and big pop-up on stream. Press again to take it out of OBS. The reward stays on in the menu either way.');
H(/also show it on my screen/i, '🖥️ On my screen too', 'Viewer\'s choice also shows over whatever you\'re using (a see-through window on the screen your mouse is on, for 10 seconds). Clicks go through it and it doesn\'t take your keyboard.');
H(/big text at the top of the pop-up/i, '🎉 Pop-up text', 'The big rainbow text at the top of the Viewer\'s choice pop-up.');
H(/^💧 hydrate$|^🙆 stretch$|^🎩 pick a hat$|^🎉 viewer's choice$|viewer rewards \(channel points/i, '🎁 Viewer reward tests', 'Pretends test_viewer redeemed it. 💧🙆🎩 pop-ups only show while Movie Royal is the window you\'re on. 🎩 opens 💬 Pretend chat so you can answer with a hat number. 🎉 plays on stream (if you added the OBS source) and on your screen.');
H(/^tip:run an? .* test$/i, '▶ Run it', 'Runs a quick pretend test of that kind of battle. The 📺 preview window pops up so you can watch it. Nothing real changes: no winners, luck, cooldowns, or packs taken from your Card pool.');
H(/^▶️ try each kind of battle$/i, '▶️ Try each kind of battle', 'One box per kind of battle: press ▶ Run it in any box to watch a quick pretend one.');
H(/keep the winner in my pool/i, '📌 Keep the winner in my pool', 'Off (the default): when a pack wins a card battle, one comes off its count in the 📦 Card pool, because you open it. On: the winner stays in your pool (nothing comes off), but it still shows in the latest winners. Pretend fights never change your pool either way.');
H(/^reload to see$/i, '🔄 Reload to see', 'Reloads the control panel so you can see it open on the 👥 People tab.');
H(/^🧙 wizard battle$|12 wizard packs/i, '🧙 Wizard Battle test', '12 pretend wizard packs on the floating platform: magic bolts, fireballs, lightning and meteors crack the stone tiles until they fall away. A pack that falls through a hole or off the edge is out. No weapons. FINAL FIGHT when 2 are left. Nothing in your Card pool changes.');
H(/^🏛️ colosseum$|12 gladiator packs/i, '🏛️ Colosseum test', '12 pretend gladiator packs in the Colosseum, each with its own weapon (sword, spear, trident, axe, mace, flail, hammer or scimitar). Nobody steals weapons. FINAL FIGHT when 2 are left. Nothing in your Card pool changes.');
H(/^🦁 lions|with 🦁 lions on|lions come out of the tunnels/i, '🦁 Lions', 'Colosseum only (it shows in the 🤪 Wacky bar when the Colosseum is the map). On: lions come out of the two tunnels and hunt the gladiators (they bite hard, but they can\'t pick the winner: that\'s still fair). Off, even in the middle of a fight: they stop attacking and walk back into the tunnels.');
H(/^🎥 card camera$|camera follows a pack/i, '🎥 Card camera test', 'Starts a pretend card fight in the Royal Rumble; after a few seconds the camera follows a pack. Then try the 🎥 Camera buttons under the fight on the Card battles tab.');
H(/^🔔 royal rumble$|10 packs in the royal rumble/i, '🔔 Royal Rumble test', '10 pretend packs in the Royal Rumble: wrestling moves (body slams, suplexes, clotheslines, Irish whips, elbow drops), steel chairs thrown in, and packs only go out over the top rope. The more hurt a pack is, the easier it goes over. When 2 are left: FINAL FIGHT with a chair each. Nothing in your Card pool changes.');
H(/pick a ring logo|ring logo:|middle of the royal rumble/i, '🔔 Ring logo', 'The picture in the middle of the Royal Rumble mat. Out of the box it is your Twitch picture. Pick your own picture here (a logo works great); ↺ Use my Twitch picture goes back. Shows when this card battle\'s map is Royal Rumble or 🎲 Random.');
H(/use my twitch picture/i, '↺ Use my Twitch picture', 'Takes your own ring logo off: the middle of the Royal Rumble shows your Twitch picture again.');
H(/^🃏 card battles only$|^⚪ ball battles only$|^⚪🃏 both battles$/i, '🗺️ Map menu sections', 'Maps only this kind of battle can use are on top (A to Z), then a line, then the maps both battles can use.');
H(/^🥊 final fight$|watch the final fight/i, '🥊 Final fight test', '6 pretend packs in Kung Fu Town: when 2 are left you see the FINAL FIGHT (weapons, the clock stops, a bell, then a timed fight).');
H(/drag to make the battle screen or the side boxes bigger/i, '↔️ Resize the boxes', 'Drag this bar left or right to make the battle screen or the boxes beside it bigger. Double-click it to go back to normal. Movie Royal remembers it.');
H(/^📦 every pack counts$|every pack you own is a fighter/i, '📦 Every pack counts', 'Every pack you own fights: 5 of one pack = 5 fighters.');
H(/^1️⃣ 1 of each$|each kind of pack fights once/i, '1️⃣ 1 of each', 'Each kind of pack fights once, however many of it you have.');
H(/elimination pacer|how hard (movie royal spreads|the knockouts are spread)/i, '⏳ Elimination pacer', 'Spreads the knockouts over the whole fight so it doesn\'t empty out in the first seconds, and makes it busier when it drags. It follows the fight length: a longer fight is paced over more time. 0 = off.');
H(/fight length|how long a fight should last/i, '⏱️ Fight length', 'How long a card battle should last. The pacer spreads the knockouts over this time. 0 = it picks a length from how many packs fight.');
H(/this card battle's name/i, '🃏 Card battle name', 'The name of this card battle (shown on stream).');
H(/remove this card battle/i, '🗑 Remove card battle', 'Removes this card battle setup. Your packs stay in the Card pool.');
H(/^🥋 go to card battles$/i, '🥋 Go to Card battles', 'Opens the 🃏 Card battles tab to start the fight.');
H(/^card battles$/i, '🃏 Your card battles', 'Your saved card battles (like battles in the 🎬 Movie Pool). Click one to change its settings and see its packs.');
H(/^📦 my packs$/i, '📦 My packs', 'Every pack you own: how many, and each one\'s chance in this card battle. Opened (none left) and hidden packs are at the bottom, darker.');
H(/^add packs: search a pack/i, '🔍 Pack search', 'Type a pack\'s name and press Search. Movie Royal looks on TCGplayer and also shows 🌐 pictures from the web, so you can pick the right picture even when a shop doesn\'t have it.');
H(/^🃏 card battles$/i, '🃏 Card battles tab', 'Your card packs fight each other on stream: packs with stick arms and legs and angry faces have a kung fu brawl. Health bars on top, blood, no luck and no chat power-ups. The winner gets opened: one comes off its count in 📦 Card pool. Being on this tab puts the card battle on stream.');
H(/^📦 card pool$/i, '📦 Card pool tab', 'Every card pack you own. Search for a pack, say how many you have, and its picture downloads by itself. Each pack you have is one fighter (5 packs = 5 fighters) unless a card battle is set to 1 of each.');
H(/FIGHT!|STOP FIGHT/, '🥋 Fight!', 'Starts the card battle with the packs in it (or stops the one going). Every pack has the same chance: no luck. The winner comes off its count in the Card pool.');
H(/^⚙ edit$|change this card battle/i, '⚙ Edit card battle', 'Change this card battle: its name, which packs fight (every pack you own, or just 1 of each), and which games (for example only Pokémon packs).');
H(/^\+ new card battle$|make another card battle/i, '+ New card battle', 'Makes another card battle, for example one with only Pokémon packs, or 1 of each pack.');
H(/^tip:clear the battlefield: the packs line up again/i, '↺ Reset battlefield (card battles)', 'Clears the fight (blood, hazards and all) and lines the packs up again, waiting for the next fight. Works on every map: Kung Fu Town and the other card maps, and the ball and 🎉 holiday maps too. During a fight it stops it.');
H(/^🤪 wacky$|wacky settings: turn them on/i, '🤪 Wacky settings', 'Silly rules for card battles: turn them on before the fight or in the middle of it, and click again to turn one off. In fullscreen they are in the panel on the left (keys 1–9 and 0).');
H(/^🪶 low gravity/i, '🪶 Low gravity', 'Floaty jumps and big flying knockbacks.');
H(/^🩸 extreme gore/i, '🩸 Extreme gore', 'Much more blood. Packs can lose arms and legs, and their face (the top of the pack) can get chopped off for an instant K.O.');
H(/^🔀 teleport switches/i, '🔀 Teleport switches', 'Every few seconds two packs swap places.');
H(/^⚡ turbo/i, '⚡ Turbo', 'Everyone moves and hits much faster.');
H(/^🐌 slow motion/i, '🐌 Slow motion', 'The whole fight in slow motion, like the movies.');
H(/^🦍 giant packs/i, '🦍 Giant packs', 'Everyone is huge.');
H(/^🐜 tiny packs/i, '🐜 Tiny packs', 'Everyone is tiny.');
H(/^🧊 slippery street/i, '🧊 Slippery street', 'The street is iced over: packs slide around and slip.');
H(/^💣 exploding k\.o/i, '💣 Exploding K.O.s', 'A knocked-out pack explodes and hurts the packs next to it.');
H(/^☠️ one-hit k\.o/i, '☠️ One-hit K.O.', 'Every clean hit knocks a pack out.');
H(/^😡 rage mode/i, '😡 Rage mode', 'The more hurt a pack is, the harder (and faster) it hits.');
H(/^🗡️ weapons/i, '🗡️ Weapons', 'Swords, staffs and nunchucks drop into the street. A pack that picks one up hits harder.');
H(/^✕ all off$|turn every wacky setting off/i, '✕ All off', 'Turns every wacky setting off.');
H(/^🃏 in this fight$/i, '🃏 In this fight', 'The packs that will fight (×n = how many of that pack you own).');
H(/latest card battle winners/i, '🏆 Card battle winners', 'The last card battles and which pack won.');
H(/search card packs|^🔍 search$/i, '🔍 Pack search', 'Type a pack\'s name (the set name + "booster pack" works best) and press Search. Pick how many you have and press ➕ Add: its picture downloads by itself.');
H(/^➕ add$/i, '➕ Add', 'Adds this pack to your Card pool, with how many you have. A pack you already have just gets more on its count.');
H(/^➕ add my own pack|add a pack that isn't in the search/i, '➕ Add my own pack', 'For a pack the search doesn\'t find: type its name and game, how many you have, and pick a picture (a link or a file).');
H(/^pack name$|^how many i have$|^picture \(a link/i, '➕ Your own pack', 'The name, how many you have and a picture for a pack you add by hand.');
H(/how many of this pack you have|^one (less|more)$/i, '🔢 How many you have', 'How many of this pack you own. Each one is a fighter. When one wins a card battle it comes off this number (you open it).');
H(/^🙈 hide$|hide this pack/i, '🙈 Hide pack', 'Hides this pack from card battles. It is never deleted: tick "Show opened + hidden packs" and press ▶ Bring back.');
H(/bring this pack back/i, '▶ Bring back', 'Puts a hidden pack back in your card battles.');
H(/^🖼️$|change the picture/i, '🖼️ Change the picture', 'Paste a link to a different picture for this pack.');
H(/show opened \+ hidden packs/i, '👁️ Show opened + hidden packs', 'Also lists packs you have none of left (all opened) and packs you hid, so you can add more or bring them back.');
H(/^all games$/i, '🎮 Game filter', 'Only show packs from one game.');
H(/^✕ close the results$/i, '✕ Close the results', 'Hides the search results.');
H(/^which packs fight$|every pack i own|just 1 of each/i, '🃏 Which packs fight', 'Every pack you own (5 of one pack = 5 fighters), or just 1 of each pack.');
H(/^which games/i, '🎮 Which games', 'Only packs from the games you tick fight in this card battle. None ticked = every game.');
H(/remove this card battle/i, '🗑 Remove card battle', 'Removes this card battle setup. Your packs stay in the Card pool.');
H(/^tip:8 pretend packs on a 🎉 holiday map/i, '🎃 Card fight on a holiday map', 'A pretend card fight on the Halloween map (a ball map). Try ↺ Reset battlefield on the Card battles tab during the fight or after it: the map clears and the packs line up again.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:the card battles tab's ↺ reset battlefield/i, '↺ Reset battlefield (test)', 'The same as ↺ Reset battlefield on the 🃏 Card battles tab: clears the card fight on any map, ball and holiday maps too.', ['test']);
H(/^⏳ no long waits$/i, '⏳ No long waits', 'Runs 6 quick battles in a hidden test screen (nothing on stream, nothing saved) with your battle timer and pacer, and shows the longest time nobody got knocked out while 3 or more were left. ✅ = 8 seconds or less, 🟡 = up to 12, ❌ = longer.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:which map the hidden battles are on/i, '🗺️ Map for the hidden battles', 'The map the ⏳ No long waits battles are on (💨 Fart Farm to start with).', ['test']);
H(/^tip:how many pieces each hidden battle has/i, '🔢 Pieces', 'How many pieces each ⏳ No long waits battle has (4 to 200).', ['test']);
H(/^tip:10 pretend packs in pirate hats/i, '🏴‍☠️ Pirate Battle (card packs)', 'A pretend card battle with 10 packs on the two pirate ships (on stream, on the 🃏 Card battles tab): the packs wear pirate hats or bandanas in their crew\'s colour, only fight the other crew, and it ends with the kraken and a FINAL FIGHT. Your Card pool doesn\'t change.', ['test']);
H(/^🏴‍☠️ pirate battle$/i, '🏴‍☠️ Pirate Battle tests', 'Try the Pirate Battle map with 🧍 characters (a battle on the Battle tab) or 📦 card packs (a card battle): pick which with Who fights, then a practice battle, a big one, straight to the kraken, in the Test lab, or the pirate finishers. Practice rounds never save anything.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:pirate tests: who fights/i, '🏴‍☠️ Who fights (pirate tests)', 'Which fighters the Pirate Battle test buttons use: 🧍 characters (a practice battle on the Battle tab, like a battle with characters on) or 📦 card packs (a pretend card battle on the Card battles tab, in pirate hats). The storm power and monkey buttons work on either one while it plays. Remembered on this computer.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:lab: card packs or characters/i, '🧪 Test lab: who fights', 'On a card map: 📦 card packs (like the Card battles tab) or 🧍 characters (like a battle with characters on, on the Battle tab). Ball maps always have packs.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:finishers with card packs or characters/i, '💀 Finishers: who', 'Watch the finisher with two 📦 card packs or two 🧍 characters (battles with characters on use the same finishers).', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a practice battle with 12 pretend pirates/i, '🏴‍☠️ Practice battle (12 pirates)', 'A practice battle on stream with 12 pretend pirates: two crews on two ships, gangplanks, rope swings and cannons, then the kraken and the FINAL FIGHT. Nothing is saved.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a practice battle with 30 pretend pirates/i, '⚔️ Big pirate battle', 'The same with 30 pretend pirates (15 in each crew).', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a practice battle where all but two pirates go out/i, '🐙 Straight to the kraken', 'A practice Pirate Battle where everyone but two pirates (one from each crew) goes out right away: you see the kraken drag one ship under, the 360° camera and the FINAL FIGHT straight away.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a pirate battle in the 🧪 test lab/i, '🧪 Pirate Battle in the Test lab', 'Runs a Pirate Battle in the 🧪 Test lab on this page only (not on stream), with characters or card packs (Who fights). Pick how many there.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:take out the movies of people who haven't been in this battle/i, "🧹 Inactive people's movies (this battle)", "On = when someone hasn't been in a battle of this battle for the time next to it (none of their movies was on the cliff in a real battle), their movies go back so anyone can pick them in Discord. They get a fresh set of picks and can pick them again later. Nothing is deleted. On by default, 3 months.");
H(/^tip:how long someone can go without being in a battle \(the number\)/i, '🧹 How long (number)', 'How many days, weeks, months or years someone can go without being in a battle before their movies go back. Saves right away.');
H(/^tip:how long someone can go without being in a battle \(days/i, '🧹 How long (days, weeks, months, years)', 'Pick days, weeks, months or years for the number next to it. Saves right away.');
H(/^tip:see who has movies in this battle, when they were last/i, "👀 Who's next", "A list of everyone with movies in this battle: when they were last in a battle, how many movies they have, and the day their movies would go back (or 'due now').");
H(/^tip:check now and take out the movies/i, '🧹 Check now', "Checks right away (it also checks by itself every hour) and sends back the movies of everyone past the limit. You'll see who in a message and in History → 🧾 Everything.");
H(/^🧹 inactive people's movies$/i, "🧹 Inactive people's movies", "Try the inactive-people rule on a pretend battle (nothing saved), or open the real setting in Settings → ⚔️ Game.");
H(/^🔄 pick up where you left off$/i, '🔄 Pick up where you left off', "When Movie Royal closes (an update while you're live) and opens again within 30 minutes, it carries on where you were: the map you picked, a best-of series, the winner card waiting for !accept / !pass, the join timer and chat's votes come back. Wheels, battles, pools and luck are saved all the time anyway. A battle that was playing can't carry on mid-fight (nothing of it counted): press Start again.", ['test']);
H(/^🔄 what would come back\?$/i, '🔄 What would come back?', 'Lists what Movie Royal would put back if it closed right now and opened again within 30 minutes. Nothing changes.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:pretend limit/i, '🧹 Pretend limit', 'The time limit for the pretend test: a number + days, weeks, months or years.', ['test']);
H(/^🧹 try it$/i, '🧹 Try it', 'Runs the rule on a pretend battle with 6 people and shows whose movies would go back. Nothing is saved.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:open the real setting in settings → game/i, '⚙️ Open the setting', "Opens Settings → ⚔️ Game at 🧹 Inactive people's movies.", ['test']);
H(/^tip:watch a pirate finisher/i, '💀 Pirate finishers', 'Picks 🏴‍☠️ Pirate Battle in 💀 Finishers & celebrations and plays one in the Test lab (pick which one there).', ['test']);
H(/^tip:look up the timepeace49 and kirbgames twitch pictures/i, '🖼️ Figurehead pictures', "Each pirate ship's figurehead (the carved medallion on the front of the ship) wears its channel's Twitch picture: TimePeace49 on the red ship, Kirbgames on the blue one. Movie Royal looks them up by itself every few hours; this button looks them up again right now (you need to be signed in to Twitch). Until it has them, the figureheads show a skull.", ['test']);
H(/^tip:a pretend big wave channel point redeem/i, '🌊 Big wave (test)', 'Pretends someone redeemed 🌊 Big wave in the Pirate Battle on stream: a huge wave rises beside one of the ships and crashes over its deck, washing pirates toward the gap (some go overboard). Start a practice Pirate Battle first.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a pretend lightning bolt channel point redeem/i, '⚡ Lightning bolt (test)', 'Pretends someone redeemed ⚡ Lightning bolt: lightning strikes a pirate and knocks them out (one that can\'t go out yet just gets shocked). Start a practice Pirate Battle first.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a pretend tentacle swipe channel point redeem/i, '🐙 Tentacle swipe (test)', 'Pretends someone redeemed 🐙 Tentacle swipe: a kraken tentacle comes out of the sea and sweeps across a deck, flinging pirates toward the gap. Start a practice Pirate Battle first.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:a pirate battle in the test lab with one of each storm power/i, '🧪 Storm in the Test lab', 'Runs a Pirate Battle in the 🧪 Test lab on this page only, with a big wave, a lightning bolt and a tentacle swipe a few seconds in.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:make the three storm power channel point rewards/i, '✨ Add storm rewards to Twitch', 'Makes the three Pirate Battle channel point rewards on Twitch: 🌊 Big wave, ⚡ Lightning bolt, 🐙 Tentacle swipe. They stay switched off (hidden) until a Pirate Battle plays. Movie Royal makes them by itself once after you sign in to Twitch; change their prices in Settings → 💰 Rewards & prices. Storm powers never change who wins.', ['test']);
H(/^tip:which of the 20 ways the winning monkey/i, '🐒 Monkey ending', "Pick which of the 20 ways the winning monkey gets taken out (kraken tentacle, lightning, a shark, a big wave, a cannonball, a seagull…), or 🎲 any one. In real Pirate Battles Movie Royal goes through all 20 in a shuffled order before any of them comes again.", ['test']);
H(/^tip:watch the monkey sword fight with that ending/i, '🐒 Watch the monkeys', "Plays a quick Pirate Battle in the 🧪 Test lab (only on this page) so you can watch the monkeys: the little T and K monkeys sword fight in the rowboat between the ships' bows, the loser goes overboard, and the winner gets taken out the way you picked.", ['test']);
H(/^tip:a pretend take out time channel point redeem/i, '🔴 Take out Time (test)', "Pretends someone redeemed Take out Time (10,000 channel points): the red T monkey in the rowboat gets taken out right away, the next way in the shuffled order. If it happens during the sword fight, the other monkey wins it and still gets taken out a moment later (both monkeys die every battle). Start a practice Pirate Battle first.", ['test']);
H(/^tip:a pretend take out kirb channel point redeem/i, '🔵 Take out Kirb (test)', "Pretends someone redeemed Take out Kirb (10,000 channel points): the blue K monkey in the rowboat gets taken out right away, the next way in the shuffled order. Start a practice Pirate Battle first.", ['test']);
H(/^tip:runs 6 hidden battles on that map/i, '▶ Run 6 hidden battles', 'Runs the 6 hidden battles (a few seconds) and lists the longest wait without a knockout in each, and whether the winner ended up on land.', ['test']);
H(/^🃏 card battle tests$|pretend fight|gore fight|wacky fight/i, '🃏 Card battle tests', 'Pretend packs fight on stream so you can see Kung Fu Town, the blood and the wacky settings. Nothing in your Card pool changes.');
H(/window mode/i, '🖥️ Window mode', 'How Movie Royal\'s own window shows: Window (a normal window), Fullscreen window (fills the screen with no border, like a game\'s borderless mode) or Fullscreen (covers everything). It changes right away.');
H(/minimize movie royal/i, '🗕 Minimize', 'Fullscreen modes have no title bar: this hides Movie Royal to the taskbar.');
H(/close movie royal \(fullscreen/i, '✕ Close', 'Fullscreen modes have no title bar: this closes Movie Royal (it asks first if the 24/7 Discord bot is off).');
H(/render scale/i, '🔍 Render scale', 'Draws the game sharper or lighter on top of the resolution: 50% is much lighter, 200% is sharpest (and heaviest).');
H(/^🎆 particles/i, '🎆 Particles', 'How many sparks, dust and blood drops are drawn. Few is lightest; Lots has no limit.');
H(/^📳 screen shake/i, '📳 Screen shake', 'How much the screen shakes on big hits. Off for a calmer picture.');
H(/^✨ glows/i, '✨ Glows', 'The soft light around pieces, sparks and titles. Off makes the game lighter to draw.');
H(/^💥 screen flashes/i, '💥 Screen flashes', 'Big hits flash the whole screen. Off is easier on the eyes.');
H(/^🧈 smooth pictures/i, '🧈 Smooth pictures', 'Posters, card packs and pictures drawn smooth. Off = crisp, pixel-style.');
H(/^📺 capture window: /i, '📺 Capture window', 'Shows a window from your PC (your browser playing a YouTube video, a game, anything) small in the top-left corner of your live OBS scene. Handy while the ⏱️ 2-min chat timer lets people join. Press again to hide it. Needs OBS set up in Settings → 🎥 OBS. ⚙ picks the window and the size.');
H(/pick the window, the size/i, '⚙ Capture window settings', 'Pick which window shows (ask OBS for the list with 🔄), how big it is, and whether it hides by itself when the battle starts.');
H(/^📺 capture window$|^which window$|^\(press 🔄 to list your windows\)|^\(pick a window\)/i, '📺 Which window', 'The window OBS captures for the capture window. Open your browser (with the YouTube video) first, then press 🔄 and pick it.');
H(/ask obs for your open windows/i, '🔄 List my windows', 'Asks OBS for the windows open on your PC right now.');
H(/make the capture window (smaller|bigger)|how big the capture window is on stream|^📏 size$/i, '📏 Capture window size', 'Makes the capture window bigger or smaller on stream (10% to 60% of the picture). While it is showing, OBS changes it right away. − and + change it in steps of 5%.');
H(/^size: .*% of the stream/i, '📏 Capture window size', 'How big the capture window is, as a part of the stream picture (30% is a small corner window).');
H(/hide it when the battle starts/i, '🙈 Hide when the battle starts', 'When ▶ START ROYAL starts the fight, the capture window hides by itself so it doesn\'t cover the battle.');
H(/^📺 capture window \(obs\)|show it for 5 seconds/i, '📺 Capture window test', 'Shows the capture window in OBS for 5 seconds, then hides it. Checks that OBS and the window you picked work.');
H(/^⚙ pick the window$/i, '⚙ Pick the window', 'Opens the capture window settings: which window, how big, and whether it hides when the battle starts.');
H(/^📌 movie winner pin/i, '📌 Movie winner pin test', 'Shows what Movie Royal pins in Twitch chat and lists in the pinned Discord message as the night goes on: the movie number of tonight\'s stream, the earlier movies and whose they were, and what happens when a wild spot wins. Pretend only: nothing is pinned or counted.');
H(/^🍿 a movie wins$/i, '🍿 A movie wins', 'Pretends a Discord movie won the next battle tonight and shows the pin it would get.');
H(/^🎟️ a wild spot wins$/i, '🎟️ A wild spot wins', 'Pretends a wild (Kirb) spot won. Nothing is pinned yet. Then press 🏆 (or 📝) to pretend the wild spot battle\'s winner.');
H(/^🏆 the wild spot battle's winner$/i, '🏆 The wild spot battle\'s winner', 'After a wild spot wins, the next battle you run (any battle that is not a chat battle or giveaway) is the wild spot battle: its winner is the movie you watch. It gets the movie number and is pinned as the wild spot\'s pick.');
H(/^📝 its winner is a text entry$/i, '📝 Its winner is a text entry', 'Pretends the wild spot battle was won by a text entry (not a movie). Movie Royal counts it as tonight\'s movie but pins nothing: you pin it yourself.');
H(/^↺ start over$/i, '↺ Start over', 'Clears the pretend night in the pin test.');
H(/^🚀 raid/i, '🚀 Raid box', 'Who chat picked to raid. Click it to start the raid (Twitch asks you to confirm). ✕ forgets the pick.');
H(/^▶ bring back$|^▶ bring them all back$/i, '▶ Bring back', 'Puts paused or taken-out entries back in the battle. Nothing is ever deleted: they stay in the list, darker, until you bring them back.');
H(/double trouble/i, '✌️ Double trouble', 'A wheel channel point reward: after redeeming, the viewer types any spot in chat and it doubles in size (the others shrink evenly; the void can\'t be picked). 2 minutes to choose.');
H(/force stop/i, '🛑 Force stop', 'A wheel channel point reward: the round ends right away, so whatever spot the wheel is on has to be done.');
H(/as plain text/i, '📝 Add as plain text', 'Adds what you typed just as words, not looked up as a movie (no poster or movie info). It plays like any other piece in this movie battle. Handy for things like "Viewer\'s choice" or "Rewatch night".');
H(/restart the discord bot|restarting…/i, '🔄 Restart the Discord bot', 'Turns your Discord bot off and on again, like restarting Movie Royal but only the bot. It reconnects to Discord and fixes its slash commands, the movie channel, the debug channel and the pinned messages. Try it when the bot shows offline or commands stop working.');
H(/^🛡️ backup bot server$/i, '🛡️ Backup bot server', 'The Movie Royal Backup Bots app (in your Start menu) runs Discord bots as a backup, yours and friends\'. If your 24/7 cloud bot has errors, it answers your Discord commands until you switch back. It starts with Windows, hidden in the tray.');

H(/^➖ knock one off$/i, '➖ Knock one off', 'For countdown spots: takes one more off the number left (in the brackets on the wheel). At 0 the spot leaves the wheel on the next spin.');
H(/^➕ put one back$/i, '➕ Put one back', 'For countdown spots: adds one back to the number left.');
H(/^🔁 .+'s respin$/i, '🔁 Respin', 'Spins again during the round. The round timer keeps going.');
H(/^📈 grow this spot$/i, '📈 Grow this spot', 'Makes the spot the wheel landed on bigger (10% of the wheel by default). The other spots make room.');
H(/^📉 shrink it$/i, '📉 Shrink it', 'Makes the spot the wheel landed on smaller. The other spots grow to fill the space.');
H(/^🙈 make it invisible$/i, '🙈 Make it invisible', 'Takes the spot the wheel landed on off the wheel, without deleting it. Bring it back with 🙈 in ✏️ Spots.');
H(/^➖ 30 sec$/i, '➖ 30 sec', 'Takes 30 seconds off the round timer.');
H(/^↗ go to the (wheel|battle) tab$/i, '↗ Go to the tab', 'Goes to the tab for what\'s on stream right now (the Battle tab or the Wheel tab).');
H(/^⤢ bigger \/ smaller$/i, '⤢ Bigger / smaller', 'Makes the preview window bigger or smaller. You can also drag its corners and edges.');
H(/^✕ close$/i, '✕ Close', 'Closes this window. (The preview window only pops up again when you run a test that changes the stream screen.)');
H(/^tip:tick it once it works/i, 'Tick when it works', 'Tick it once you\'ve tried it and it worked. Ticks are remembered on this computer.');
H(/^see them$/i, 'See them', 'Opens Settings → ⌨️ Key binds.');
H(/^how$/i, 'How', 'Shows how to try this one: it takes you to the right place and tells you what to press.');
H(/^see it$/i, 'See it', 'Takes you to where this is in the app so you can check it.');
H(/^fps counter$/i, '📈 FPS counter', 'Shows the frame rate counter in the game screen for 15 seconds, so you can see what your graphics settings give you.');
H(/^show it$/i, 'Show it', 'Shows the pop-up right now so you can see what it looks like.');
H(/^default background$/i, 'Default background', 'Goes back to the normal background for this wheel (no picture or color of your own).');

H(/^🔥 your last \d+ streams$/i, '🔥 Last streams', 'Your newest streams, newest first: ✅ = they watched it (chatted or were in the viewer list while you were live), ❌ = they missed it. Missing one starts the watch streak over.');

H(/when this spot wins|^nothing else$|spin another wheel|play a battle, then/i, '🔀 When this spot wins', 'Link this spot to another wheel or a battle. When it wins, that wheel comes on stream and spins by itself (or that battle comes on stream), then Movie Royal comes back to this wheel once it has its winner. With a round timer it happens when the timer runs out on this spot; with no round timer, as soon as the wheel lands here.');
H(/start the battle by itself/i, '⚔️ Start the battle by itself', 'On: the linked battle starts a few seconds after it comes on stream. Off: it waits for you to press START.');
H(/^💜 twitch$/i, '💜 Twitch', 'Twitch app keys for the backup bots app.');

SECTION(null);
